<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Josh</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chaka Yoshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yosh</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chaka Yoshua</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu chaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoshua</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chaka Yoshua chijendalela kulandila histolia ja litaifa la Izilaeli koni chakatumbulaje pandu pala ambapu Chitabu cha Kombukombu la Tolati pachijomukela. Chikahi Chitabu chaka Yoshua pachitumbula kulandila kwaki, Bhaizilaeli bhakabhili bhabhekiki likambi ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani. Chitabu chenu chilongalela ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhalombukile nkoka wa Yoludani na kubhashinda bhenei bha inchi ja Kanaani, koni bhakabyaje pahi ja ulonguheku waka Yoshua joakumpwelile Musa ngati chiongozi wa litaifa. Bhakahengiki bhenibhela maghambu Chapanga akabhalaghalakili bhahengaje bhenibhela. Mu lijambu aleli, Chapanga akabhili atimiza chilanga cheakalaghile kubha anaabhapekyaje bhabhelakeka bhaka Ibulahimu inchi jeniheji ambaju jakabhili jitamakika na Bhakanaani (Utumbulilu 12:7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngacheimanyikana kubha nde nane joakachilembiki chitabu chaka Yoshua. Mu chikahi yengi, mlemba antenda mundu kuholakela kubha mweni akabhili ashiliki matukiu ghokapi ghaghakabhili ghapitalila (kwa ulenganesu, Yoshua 5:1, 6). Kubhokana na ndandi ajeji, bhasomi bhamaheli bha mambu gha Bibilia bhaholakela kubha Yoshua mweni nde joakalembiki pandu pakolongwa pa chitabu chenu. Bhelabhela nde chakaka kubha mundu jongi tofauti na Yoshua akalembiki pandu pakumu pa chitabu chenu, ngati bhela, malobhi gha kupotela na kutaghakika kwaka Yoshua (Yoshua 24:29). Bhasomi bhangi bhahobhalela kubha chitabu chenu chakalembakiki ngati hyaka 800 baada ja lijambu leniheli kupitalila. Mambu ghaghalongaleka mkati ja Chitabu chaka Yoshua iwezikana ghakapitalili mu chaka cha 1250 K. K. Ngati hyaka 40 baada jaka Falao Lamesesi kutumbula kutawala inchi ja Misili. Lamesesi ajoju nde mtawala joaholaleka kubha akatawili inchi ja Misili mu chikahi bhandu bha izilaeli pabhakabhili bhabhoka mu Misili (Kubhoka 1:11).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ja 1 mbaka ja 5:12 ilongalela ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhalombukile nkoka Yoludani na kujingila mu inchi ja Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete mu sula ja 5:13 mbaka sula ja 12 ilongalela mipangu ja Bhaizilaeli kujilapula na kubhaweza bhandu bha inchi ja Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="io">Paghajomwiki ghanihagha, sula ja 13 mbaka ja 21 ilongalela ntundu inchi ja Kanaani mojaghabhakike kwa makabila ghokapi komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Kujomulela, sula ja 22 mbaka ja 24 ilandila ntundu makabila ghakumu moghakelabhukile ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, malobhi gha kujomulela ghaka Yoshua kwa litaifa la Izilaeli, kupotela na kutaghakika kwaki papamu na ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhakatendile kwa kukelabhukila lulaghilu lwabhu na Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga andaghalakila Yoshua kujitola mateka inchi ja Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Paakajomwiki Musa ntumika waka Bambo Chapanga, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, njangatila waka Musa, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />Mtumika wangu Musa apotile. Henu wehapa papamu na bhandu bhokapi abhabha, muliandiyaje kulomboka nkoka aghoghu wa Yoludani kujingila mu inchi ambuju numpekeha mwehapa mabhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kila pandu lwaju lwa magholu ghinu pamwikanyataje numpekihi mwehapa, ngati bhela monukundapile Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Malindakanilu gha inchi jinu anaghakubha anana: Kunkache nde lipololu, kungonde nde itombi ya Lebanoni, kolipita lyobha nde nkoka ghola ukolongwa wa Eufulati, kupetela mbaka inchi jokapi ja Bhahiti, mbaka bahali ngolongwa ja Meditelania jejibhili upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Nga mundu jokapi joanaakuwezaje wehapa machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaku. Ngati bhela monabhelili papamu na Musa, nde bhelabhela monibhelilaje papamu na wehapa, nganakuleki wala nganakukepakele. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />“Ukubhaje na makili na mtima wa kukangamala, maghambu wehapa nde weubhalonguaje bhandu abhabha kujenda kujitola nchi jenabhalaghile kubhapekeha akahokulu bhabhu. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Ukubhaje na makili, na ukangamalu wamaheli. Ukangamalaje kukamula shelia yokapi yeakupeki Musa mtumika wangu, ngawaileka shelia yangu, nahuli upata kufanikiwa pokapi paujenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Ngawilibhalila kulibhola chitabu achechi cha Shelia chikahi chokapiu, nambu ughaholalya malobhi ghaki ikilu na muhi, nahuli upata kulingalila kuhenga ngati moipalakila kubhokana na malobhi ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mkati jaki. Panihapa nde anaufanikiwaje, na kuneng'anela pokapi paujenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Bho, nga nepani le nenukulaghalakile? Ukubhaje na makili na mtima wa kukangamala. Ngawijoghopa wala ngawihekateka mtima, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, anaakubhaje papamu na wehapa pokapi pawijendaje.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua abhalaghalakila bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Bhela Yoshua akabhalaghalakili ihongozi bha manjolinjoli, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />Mpetaje mu makambi ghokapi na kubhalaghalakila bhandu, “Mbekaje tayali ilebhi hinu. Machobha ghatatu kutumbu sajeno anandombukaje nkoka Yoludani nahuli kujingila na kujitama inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekeha mwehapa kubha jinu mabhete.”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Kabhete Yoshua akabhapwaghili bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, likabila laka Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Mkombukyaje lilaghalakilu laka Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga leakumpekihe, ‘Bambo Chapanga, Chapanaga winu ampekeha mwehapa pandu pa kupomulela, najombi ampekihi inchi ajeji upambala wa kolipita lyobha mwa nkonka Yoludani.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Akabhahanu bhinu, bhana bhinu na hinyamba jinu anajitama mu nchi heji Musa jeampekihi upambala wa kolipita lyobya wa Yoludani, nambu akanalomi bhokapi bhabhaweza kukomana ngondo, koni bhakabya na silaha bhalombukaje nkoka na kubhalongulela bhalongu bhabhu, nahuli mpataje kubhajangatila bhalongu bhinu, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />Bambo Chapanga ampekyaje chiheku mwehapa papamu nabhu, ngati moakumpekihe mwehapa, nabhombi bhelabhela bhatamaje mu inchi jebhapekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Bhela mwikelabhukaje mu inchi ambaju nde jinu mabhete na kutama monihomu, inchi ambaju mkapekiwi na Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Panihapa bhakamuyangiki Yoshua, “Chokapi cheutulaghalakile anatuhengaje, na pokapi pawatutumaje anatujendaje. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Ngati bhela motukabhi tunjowanela Musa mu mambu ghokapi, bhenibhela nde motwakujowanyaje wehapa. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, akubhaje papamu na wehapa pela, ngati bhela moakabhelile papamu na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Mundu jokapi joanakotukaje kutii amuli jaku, kukana kughatii malobhi ghaku, au lijambu lokapi lela lewandaghalakyaje, anaakomakikaje. Nambu wehapa ukubhaje na makili, na ukangamalu pela!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua abhatuma bhapelelezi ku Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Bhela Yoshua mwana waka Nuni kwa sili akabhatumiki bhapelelezi bhabheli kuhuma ku Shitimu, akabhapwaghile, “Njendaje mkajikaghulyaje inchi jeniheje, nakanopi muchi wa Yeliko.” Bhela bhakapiti na kujingila mu nyumba jaka nkemi jumu lihina laki Lahabu na kutama monihomo. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Yeliko akapwaghakike, “Lingalyaje! Bhaizilaeli bhakumu bhahikiki kongoni ikilu jenu kujipeleleza inchi.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Bhela nkolongwa wa ku Yeliko akatumiki bhandu kwaka Lahabu, akapwaghaje, “Ubhapihaje bhandu bhala bhabhakuhikile na kujingila munyumba jaku, maghambu bhahikiki kujipeleleza inchi jokapi!”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Nambu mbomba hoju akabhi abhatoi bhandu bhabheli habha na kubhahiya. Akapwaghike, “Ena, bhandu bhanihaba bhakahikiki kwangu, nambu ngachemanyi kobhahumike. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Palwajingi lubhendu, chikahi cha kujighila ndyangu wa muchi, bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhokike, ngachemanyi kobhapite. Mubhalonda manyata, pangi muweza kabhapata.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Nambu Lahabu akabhi abhakwehiki kunani kugholu akabhayekalili kwa mapei gha kulenganakela ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, ghaghakabhi aghajaliki kugholu. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Bhela bhandu bhanihabha bhabhakatumakiki na nkolongwa bhakabhajengalili kupetela indela jejijenda mu ilombukelu ya nkoka Yoludani. Chikahi pela bhandu bhabhakabhi bhajengalela bhapelelezi pabhapitiki kunja. Ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi ukajighalike. <verse eid="JOS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Mangani ja bhapelelezi bhala kughonela, Lahabu akabhajendili kunani kugholu kola, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />akabhapwaghile, “Manyi kubha Bambo Chapanga ampekihi inchi jenjenu na lujoghopu lukolongwa lutuhabhukili kwa ndandi jinu, na kubha bhenei bhokapi bha muchi ghongoni bhahekatiki mtima kwa ndandi jinu. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Ndandi tujowini ntundu Bambo Chapanga moaghatendili machi gha bahali ja Shamu kujomalela palongi jinu pamukabhi mboka mu inchi ja Misili, na lijambu lela lemubhatendili Sihoni na Ogu, bhakolongwa bhabheli bha Bhaamoli bhabhakabhili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, yani Sihoni na Ogu, ambabhu mkabhayoningi nakanopi. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Chikahi pela patukajowini mambu ghanihagha, mitima jitu jakapotile, na kila jumu witu akalepiki kubha na ukangamalu kwa ndandi jinu. Maghambu sajenu nimanyi kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde Chapanga wa kunani kumahunde na pahi pani pundema. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Chikai chenu, nundobha, chondi mnapilaje kwaka Bambo Chapanga, kubha anandendilaje ghamboni nepani na bhalongu bhaka tati wangu, maghambu nepani nuntendili ghamboni. Mbekyaje nginyulila ja kundenda nepani nunhobhalya mwehapa. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Mnaghilaje kubha anamughalamihaje matamu ghaka tati wangu na mabhu wangu, bhalongu bhangu bha chikambaku na bhalongu bhangu bha chimbomba, papamu na bhokapi bhabhabhili mu nyumba yabhu, na kutukengalela na nyiwa.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Akanalomi bhala bhakayangike, “Chapanga na aghatolaje matamu ghitu ngati ngatwihengi ngati motupwaghila! Ngati ngawibhohi malobhi gha chindu bholi chetuhenga, chikahi Bambo Chapanga paatupekyaje inchi jenjenu, anatukuhengilaje kwamboni na kwa ulongwana.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Bhela Lahabu akabhahelihi bhandu bhanihabha kwa ngonji kupetela palidilisha, maghambu nyumba jaki jakachengakiki kwa kulombana na lumatu lwa muchi wa Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Akabhapwaghile, “Njendaje ku itombi kujobhalela nahuli bhala bhabhunjengalela ngabhunhimanila. Ntamanya konihoku kwa machobha ghatatu, mbaka pabhikelabhukaje, na panihapa nde mwijendaje.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Bhandu bhala bhakamuyangike, “Tepani anatuhengaje lijambu lenu leututendiki tulaghilaje kwa kulapa. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Lingalyaje, lendenu nde lelikupalika kulihenga. Patwihikaje mu inchi jenjenu, ukongaje ngoji ghongoni ukeli pa lidilisha lela leutuhelihe, na ubhaletaje munyumba jaku tati waku, mabhu waku, bhalongu bhaku na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati waku. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Ngati mundu jokapi anaapitiki kunja ja nyumba jaku, tepani ngatwikubhi na hatia panani ja kupotela kwaki. Nambu mundu jola joanakubhaje mkati papamu na wehapa, ngati chiwoku chaka mundu jokapi anachibhili panani jaki, bhela kupotela kwaka mundu hoju anakukubhaje panani jitu. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Nambu anaubhohiki malobhi gha lihengu litu letuhenga, anatubya tuhoghuliwi kuhuma mu kulapa akoku koututendiki tulapaje.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Najombi akayangike, “Na kukubhaje bhelabhela ngati mompwaghile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 2:21">Panihapa akabhapihiki, nabhombi bhakapite, najombi akakongiki ngoji ukeli ghola palidilisha.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Bhapelelezi habha pabhabhokike, bhakapiti ku itombi na kutama konihoku machobha ghatatu, mbaka bhala bhabhakabhi bhajengalela pabhakelawike, na bhandu bhala bhabhakabhi bhajengalela bhakabhajengalili mu indela jenijela jokapi, nambu ngachebhawene. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Bhela bhapelelezi bhabheli habha bhakehelili kuhuma ku itombi, bhakalombwiki nkoka wa Yoludani na kunjendela Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, na kumpwaghila kila chindu chechabhapatike. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Bhakumpwaghili Yoshua, “Chakaka Bambo Chapanga atupekihi inchi jokapi mu mabhoku ghitu, maghambu bhandu bhokapi bhahekatiki mitima kwa kutujoghopa tepani.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhalomboka nkoka Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Yoshua na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakabhokiki lukela pachibhombu kuhuma ku Shitimu, na kujenda mpaka ku nkoka Yoludani, na kubheka likambi konihoku mangane ja kulomboka. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Paghapetiki machobha ghatatu ihongozi bhakapetiki pachilanda ja likambi lokapi, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />na kubhalaghalakila bhandu, “Pamwalibhonaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, litolakeka na bhapenganyambiku ambabhu nde bhabhelakeka bha Bhalawi, mwibhokaje pandu pani pambile na kulijengalela. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Bhenibhela nde momwimanyilaje indela jempalika kujipeta, maghambu ngachendabhalili kujipeta indela jeniheje. Nambu ngamwiheghalela pambipi na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu heli, impalika mkubhaje na utali wa ngati kilomita jimu pachilanda jinu na Lisanduku heli.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Bhela Yoshua akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mligholulaje, maghambu chilabhu Bambo Chapanga anahengaje mambu gha kukangacha pachilanda jinu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Yoshua akabhapwaghi bhapenganyambiku, “Mlijinulaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, na kulongulela palongi ja bhandu.” Bhela bhakalijinwihi na kulongulela palongi jabhu.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Lalenu anandumbulaje kukulumbalila palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, nahuli bhapata kumanya kubha nepani mili papamu na wehapa, ngati monakabhelile papamu na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Ubhapwaghila bhapenganyambiku bhabhatoghola Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, ‘Pamwihikaje mukengu ja machi gha nkoka Yoludani, njendaje mkajemaje mkati ja nkoka.’ ” <verse eid="JOS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yoshua akabhapwaghi bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Muhikaje pambani njowanyaje malobhi ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Yoshua akajendali kupwagha, “Chakaka kwa lijambu aleli anammanyaje kubha Chapanga joabhi mwomi abhili pachilanda jinu, na kubha anaabhatopulaje palongi jinu Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhahivi, Bhapelizi, Bhagiligashi, Bhaamoli na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Chikahi Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga wa ndema wokapi palandongulyaje palongi jinu na kujingila mu nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Bhela, sajenu mubhahaghulaje akanalomi komi na bhabheli kuhuma mu makabila gha Izilaeli, kila likabila mundu jumu. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Chikahi pela lwaju ya bhapenganyambiku bhabhatotola Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa ndema wokapi, paijingalaje mu machi gha nkoka Yoludani, machi ghanihagha anaghakotukaje kunyila. Machi ghaghikubhaje ghanyila kuhuma upambala wa kundonda anaghalibhonganaje pandu pamu na kubha ngati chihogholu.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Bhela, bhandu pabhakabhokiki mu makambi ghabhu, nahuli kulomboka nkoka Yoludani, bhapenganyambiku koni bhakabya bhatotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu bhakabhalongulile. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Chikahi chenu chakabhili chikahi cha mahunu, nawombi nkoka Yoludani ukabhi utwelili mbaka mukengu jaki ngati moukabhelili ntetu waki. Nambu chikahi pela bhapenganyambiku bhabhatotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu pabhahikiki punkoka na lwaju yabhu kujibhila mkati ja machi ghanighala, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />machi ghala ghaghakabhili ghanyila kuhuma upambala wa kundonda ghakajemiki na kulibhongana mbaka ku chijiji chechilowakeka Adamu, ku muchi wa Seletani. Machi ghaghakabhi ghanyila kujenda ku bahali ja Alaba, yani Bahali ja Mwinyu, ghakabhokiki ghokapi, bhela bhandu bhakalombwiki kujenda ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Bhapenganyambiku bhabhatotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga bhala, bhakajemiki wichu pandu pajomu pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani, chikahi Bhaizilaeli bhokapi pabhakabhi bhalomboka mu pandu pajomu, mbaka bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhakajomwili kulomboka nkoka Yoludani.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Maganga gha ukombukeli wa kulomboka nkoka Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Chikahi bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhajomwili kulomboka nkoka Yoludani, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Muhaghulaje akanalomi komi na bhabheli pachilanda ja makabila gha Izilaeli, kila likabila mundu jumu, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />nanau ubhapwaghila bhatola imaghu komi na ghabheli pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani, kuhuma pandu pala pabhajemiki bhapenganyambiku, bhaghatolaje na kughabheka pandu pamwighonilaje ikilu ja lalenu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Bhela Yoshua akabhakemiki akanalomi komi na bhabheli ambabhu bhakabhi bhahaghulike kuhuma pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli, kila likabila mundu jumu, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />najombi akabhapwaghile, “Ndongulyaje palongi ja Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujenda pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani. Kila jumu winu ajinulaje liganga palibhegha laki, kulengana na ubhalangiku wa makabila gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Lijambu leniheli analikubhaje ngati ukombukelu pachilanda jitu, na bhana bhitu pabhatulalukyaje mu machobha ghaghahika, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Bho, maganga aghagha ndandi jaki kike?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Mwapwaghilaje kubha machi gha nkoka Yoludani ghaghakabhi ghanyila ghakalibhongini chikahi Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga palakabhili lilomboka nkoka Yoludani, machi gha nkoka ghonihoghu ghakalibhongini ngaghinyila. Maganga ghangani anaghakubhaje ukombukelu kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli mileli.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakatendiki ngati Yoshua moakabhalaghalakile. Bhakatoliki maganga komi na ghabheli kuhuma pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani, kulengana na ubhalangiku wa makabhila gha Izilaeli ngati Bambo Chapanga moakumpwaghi Yoshua, nabhombi bhakaghatotwili mbaka kulikambi labhu, pandu pabhaghaheli pahi. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yoshua akaghajemiki maganga komi na ghabheli pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani, pandu pala ambapu magholu gha bhapenganyambiku bhabhatowili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu paghajemike. Naghombi ghabhili konihoku mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Bhapenganyambiku bhabhatowili Lisanduku lela bhakabhili bhahighalili koni bhakabya bhajemiki mumachi gha nkoka Yoludani mbaka kila chindu Bambo Chapanga cheakundaghalakili Yoshua pachabhili chihengakiki na bhandu. Yoshua akahengiki kila chindu ngati moakalaghalakiwi na Musa. Bhandu bhakatehi manyata kulomboka nkoka, <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />na chikahi pela bhandu bhokapi pabhajomwili kulomboka, Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga na bhapenganyambiku bhakalombwiki koni bhandu bhakabya bhalingalila. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Akanalomi bha likabila la Bhaleubeni, Bhagadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase, bhakalombwiki palongi ja Bhaizilaeli bhajabhu, koni bhakabya bhawati silaha yabhu, ngati Musa moakabhapwaghile. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Bhakabhili ngati akanalomi elufu alobaini bhabhakabhi bhawati silaha kwa ndandi ja ngondo, bhakapetiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kujenda kungondo, mbaka ku uwanda wa muchi wa Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Lichobha leniheli Bambo Chapanga akundumbalili Yoshua pachilanda ja bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, nabhombi bhakuntopili machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki, ngati mobhakuntopile Musa mu matamu ghaki ghokapi.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Ubhalaghalakyaje bhapenganyambiku bhabhatotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu habha, kubha bhakwelaje kuhuma mkati ja nkoka Yoludani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Bhela Yoshua akabhalaghalakili bhapenganyambiku akapwaghaje, “Nkwelaje kuhuma mkati ja nkoka Yoludani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Nabhombi bhapenganyambiku bhakakweliki kuhuma mkati ja nkoka Yoludani koni bhalitotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga. Chikahi pela pabhakabhekiki magholu ghabhu mukengu, kunja ja nkoka, machi gha nkoka Yoludani ghakatumbwi kunyila kabhete, na kutwelela ngati moghabheli pakutumbula.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Lichobha la komi la mwehi wa kutumbula bhandu bhakakweliki kuhuma ku nkoka Yoludani na kubheka likambi ku muchi wa Giligali, ku malindakanilu gha kolipita lyobha gha ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Najombi Yoshua akaghajemiki ku muchi wa Giligali hoku maganga komi na ghabheli ghabhaghatoliki pachilanda ja nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Akabhapwaghili bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Bhana bhitu pabhatulalukyaje tepani akatati bhabhu mu machogha ghaghahika, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Bho, maganga aghagha ndandi jaki kike?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Bhela mubhapwaghilaje, ‘Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakalombwiki pandu pajomu mu nkoka ghoni wa Yoludani.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akaghatendiki machi gha nkoka Yoludani ghajomalyaje palongi jinu, mbaka pamwajomwili kulomboka. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akahengiki aghagha kulengana na chela cheakahengiki ku Bahali ja Shamu, chikahi paakajitendiki kujomalela palongi jitu mbaka patukajomwili kulomboka. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Akatendiki anana nahuli mataifa ghokapi gha ndema ghapata kumanya kubha chiwoku chaka Bambo Chapanga nde chechibhili na makili, nahuli mpataje kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, mileli.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Bhela bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Bhaamoli bhabhakabhi bhatama ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, na bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Bhakanaani bhabhakabhi ku maheku ja bahali ja Meditelania, pabhakajowini kubha Bambo Chapanga akaghatendiki machi gha nkoka Yoludani kujomalela palongi ja Bhaizilaeli mbaka pabhajomwili kulomboka, bhakahekatiki mitima kwa lujoghopu, wala ngachebhakabhili na ukangamalu wa kukomana na bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhaheketwa jando ku Giligali hoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Chikahi hechi Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ulenganakyaje mipamba ja maganga gha kunonopa nakanopi na ubhahekata jando Bhaizilaeli ambabhu ngachebhakahekiti jando pakutumbula hapa.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Bhela Yoshua akalenganakili mipamba ja maganga gha kunonopa namaa, na kubhaheketa jando Bhaizilaeli ku Gibea Haalaloti hoku. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Yoshua akahengiki bhenibhela maghambu akanalomi bhokapi bhabhahumiki ku Misili, bhokapi bhabhakabhili na umule wa kujenda ku ngondo, bhakapotili mumwanja kuchingwenji hoku, chikahi pabhakabhokiki ku inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Hata ngati bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhokiki ku Misili bhakabhili bhahekitwi jando, nambu bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhelakiki kuchingwenje bhakabya mumwanja kuhuma ku Misili bhakabhili ngachebhahitwi jando. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mwanja kwa hyaka alobaini mulipololu, hata akanalomi bhokapi bhabhakabhi na umuli wa kujenda kungondo bhakayonangike, maghambu ngachebhunjowanili Bambo Chapanga. Kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akabhalapili bhandu bhanihabha kubha ngabhajibhoni inchi jela jejitwelile mahibha na busi ambaju jombi akabhalapili akahokolu bhabhu kubha anaabhapekyaje. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Bhela akabhatoliki bhana bha chikambaku bhala na kubhabheka pandu pa akatati bhabhu, na bhanihabha nde ambabhu Yoshua akabhahekiti jando. Bhakabhili bhakali ngachebhahekitwi jando maghambu bhakabhili mumwanja.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Baada ja bhandu bhokapi kuheketwa jando, bhakajendalili kutama mulikambi, mbaka akanalomi bhokapi pabhakabhili bhalamike. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Lalenu mohiki iyoni ja utumwa ghomukabhili nau mu inchi ja Misili.” Bhela pandu panipala pakalowakiki Giligali mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhili bhabhekiki likambi ku Giligali hoku bhakatendiki Uwangalalu wa Pasaka pakamihi ja lichobha la komi na nchechi la mwehi, ku uwanda wa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Lichobha la kabheli baada ja Pasaka, mu lichobha lela lela, bhakakuliki mahunu gha inchi jela, mabumunda ghangakujegheleka amila, na bisi. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Bhela, kutumbula lichobha lela Bhaizilaeli pabhakuliki mahunu gha inchi, ngachebhapatiki kabheti mana. Nambu kutumbula mu chaka chenihechi Bhaizilaeli bhakakuliki mahunu gha inchi ja Kanaani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua na nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Bhela lichobha limu Yoshua paakabhili pambipi na muchi wa Yeliko, akalingalili, na palapala akumbweni mundu ajemiki palongi jaki, akabhili akamwili lipanga lelibhohakiki muala mumabhoku ghaki. Yoshua akunjendili na kundalukila, “Bho, wehapa le ubhi upambala witu, au upambala wa adui bhitu?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Najombi akayangike, “Ngabhela, nepani ngachemili upambala wokapi ghola, nambu nepani nhikiki ngati nkolongwa wa linjolinjoli laka Bambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 5:14">Yoshua akachikimi ukutama mbaka pahi, na kujojabhela, bhela akalalukile, “Bambo, bho, ubhili na ubholu bhole kwangu nepani mtumika wako?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Nkolongwa wa linjolinjoli waka Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Yoshua, “Uhulaje magubasi ghaku mu magholu ghaku, maghambu pandu paujemiki hapa nde pandu pahuhu.” Najombi Yoshua akahengiki bhenibhela.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhauteka muchi wa Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Bhela milyangu ja kujingalila muchi wa Yeliko jakabhi jijighaliki wichu kwa ndandi ja kubhahibhalila Bhaizilaeli ngabhijingila. Njeta mundu jokapi jola joakapitiki kunja wala kujingila mkati. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Lingalyaje, nijibhekiki Yeliko pahi ja lujiniku lwaku, papamu na nkolongwa waki na bhandu bhaki bha ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Uyongalutaje muchi mala punkamu wehapa, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhatotwili silaha ya ngondo. Utendaje bhenibhela kwa machobha sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Ukubhaje na bhapenganyambiku saba bhakabya bhatotwi mbata ya manyelu gha mambeleli makambaku palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu. Lichobha la saba pela, muyongolutaje muchi ghonihoghu mala saba, nabhombi bhapenganyambiku bhapulaje mbata yabhu. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Bhela pawijowanaje sauti ya mbata ipulakika kwa sauti ngolongwa, ubhapwaghilaje bhandu bhokapi bhajamalyaje kwa sauti ngolongwa, panihapa lumatu lwa muchi hoghu analuhabhukaji na bhandu anabhakwelaje, kila mundu ajendalyaje kulongi kuhuma pandu paabhile.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Bhela Yoshua, mwana waka Nuni, akabhalohiki bhapenganyambiku na kubhapwaghila, “Ntolaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, na bhapenganyambiku saba bhatolaje mbata ya manyelu gha mambeleli makambaku na kulongulela palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Najombi akabhalaghalakili bhandu, “Njendalyaje kulongi, mkauyongalutaje muchi, na bhalonda bhachokopi bhabhabhili na silaha ibhapalika bhalongulyaje palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Bhela chikahi Yoshua paakajomwili kulongela na bhandu, bhapenganyambiku saba bhabhatotwili mbata saba palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga bhala, bhakalongulili palongi, koni bhakapulaje mbata yabhu na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga lakabhajengalile. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Bhalonda bhakumu bhabhakabhili na silaha bhakapiti palongi ja bhapenganyambiku bhabhakabhili bhapula mbata, na bhalonda bhangi bhakajengalili kunyuma ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu. Chikahi chokapi hechi mbata yakabhili ijendalela kupulakika. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Nambu Yoshua akabhalaghalakili bhandu, “Ngamwilapula njobhela, wala sauti hinu ngaijowaneka, wala lilobhi lokapi lela ngalijowaneka mumilomu jinu, mbaka lichobha lela panampwaghilaje ndapulaje njobhela, panihapa nde mwilapulaje njobhela.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Bhela akalipeliki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga kuyongolota muchi ghonihoghu, bhandu bhakabhili bhaliyongoloha mala punkamu kila lichobha, na kukelabhuka kujenda kughonela kulikambi.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Yoshua akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu mu lichobha lelijengalyaje, nabhombi bhapenganyambiku bhakalitoliki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Bhapenganyambiku saba bhala bhabhakatotwili mbata saba yela bhakalongulili palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, koni bhakajendalyaje kuipula mbata heyi. Bhandu bhabhabhili na silaha bhakalongulili palongi jabhu, bhalonda bhangi bhabhabhili munyuma bhakalijengalili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, koni mbata ikajendalyaje kupulakika. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Lichobha la kabheli bhakayongalwiti muchi mala punkamu, na kukelabhuka kulikambi. Bhakahengiki bhenibhela kwa machobha sita.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Mu lichoba la saba, bhakajumwiki lukela pachibhombu na kuyongalota muchi ghonihoghu mala saba kwa ntundu gholaghola ngati mobhakabhi bhahenga. Nambu mu lichobha leniheli pela bhakauyongalwiti muchi ghonihoghu mala saba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Pabhakauyongalwiti mala ja saba, chikahi bhapenganyambiku bhakapulaje mbata yabhu kwa sauti ngolongwa, Yoshua akabhalaghalakili bhandu akapwaghaje, “Ndapulaje njobhela! Maghambu Bambo Chapanga ampekihi muchi ghongone! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Muchi ghongoni papamu na kila chindu chekibhi mkati jaki anaiyonangikaje kubha nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Nambu Lahabu pela, nkemi jola na bhokapi bhabhabhili munyumba jaki nde bhabhilamaje, maghambu akabhahiiki bhapelelezi bhatubhatumike. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Nambu mulijepaje na hindu yeibhekakiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga nahuli iyonangikaje, ngati anantoliki chindu chokapi chela chechibhekakiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga nahuli chiyonangikaje, anamulitendaje likambi la Izilaeli kubha chindu cha kuyonangeka, na kuliletela mang'ahiku. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Nambu madini gha feza, zahabu, yombu ya shaba, na ya choma nde ihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Yeniheyi ipalika ndetaje mu chikoku chaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Chikahi bhapenganyambiku pabhakapuliki mbata yabhu, bhandu bhakajowini sauti jeniheji na kujamalila kwa sauti ngolongwa, panihapa lumatu lwa muchi lukahawiki pahi. Bhela bhandu bhakakweliki na kujenda kulongi kuhuma pandu pabhakabhile, na kuutola mateka muchi. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Bhela bhakayoningi kila chindu chechikabhili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu kwa kubhakoma kwa lipanga, akanalomi na akambomba, akakombu na bhazee, ng'ombi, mambeleli na maponda.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yoshua akabhapwaghili bhandu bhabheli bhabhapiti kujipeleleza inchi bhala, “Njendanyaje kunyumba jaka nkemi jola, mukundetaje jombi papamu na bhokapi bhabhabhili munyumba jaki, ngati momukundapile.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Bhela akakombu bhapelelezi bhala bhakapiti, na kundeta Lahabu, tati waki, mabhu waki, bhabheli bhaki, na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhili papamu nabhu, na kubhabheka kunja ja likambi la Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Bhela bhakaujochiki muchi wokapi na kila chindu chechikabhili mkati jaki. Nambu madini gha feza, zahabu, yombu ya shaba na ya choma, bhakaibhekiki mu chikoku chaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Nambu Yoshua akaghakengalili matamu ghaka Lahabu nkemi jola, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati waki, na hindu yokapi yebhakabhi nayu, maghambu akabhahiiki bhapelelezi bhabhatumakiki na Yoshua kuupeleleza muchi wa Yeliko, najombi atama pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Chikahi chela Yoshua akabhalakalili, akapwaghaje, “Mundu joanajinukaje na kuuchenga kabheti muchi ghongoni wa Yeliko, apataje masolu kuhuma kwaka Bambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Jokapi joanachengaje luhuli lwa muchi ghongoni, mbelakeka waki wa kutumbula wa chikambaku na apotilaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Jokapi joanachengaje kabheti milyangu ja muchi ghongoni, mwana waki wa kujomulela na apotilaje.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhili papamu na Yoshua, na sifa yaki yakajaghanili pa inchi jokapi.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahoku ghaka Akani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakabhili bhalongwana kubhokana na hindu yela yeyabhohakiki kuyonangeka, ndandi Akani mwana waka Kalimi, nchokolu waka Zabudi, wa lukolu lwaka Zela, wa likabila laka Yuda, akatoliki hindu yakumu yeyalaghalakiwi iyonangikaje. Bhela inyela yaka Bambo Chapanga yakabhelili panani ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Bhela Yoshua akabhatumiki bhandu kuhuma ku Yeliko kujenda ku muchi wa Ai, pambipi na Beta Aveni, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Betali, akabhapwaghile, “Mkwelaje kundonda mkajipelelizaje inchi.” Bhela bhakakweliki na kujenda kuupeleleza muchi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Pabhakelawiki kwaka Yoshua, bhakapwaghike, “Njeta ndandi ja kubhapeleka bhandu bhokapi kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Ai. Ubhatumaje bhandu elufu ibheli au elufu itatu bhakautekaje muchi ghonihoghu. Njeta ndandi ja kubhang'aha bhandu bhokapi, maghambu konihoku kubhili na bhandu bhachokopi pela.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Bhela bhakapiti ngati bhandu elufu itatu pela, nambu bhakatopuliki na bhandu bha ku muchi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Bhandu bha ku muchi wa Ai bhakabhakomiki ngati bhandu selasini na sita pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli. Bhakabhatopwili Bhaizilaeli kuhuma pa ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi mbaka ku Shebalimu, na bhakabhakomiki kunhelelu hoku. Kubhokana na lijambu leniheli Bhaizilaeli bhakahekatiki mitima na kujoghopa namaa.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Bhela Yoshua akakachwili ingobhu yaki, jombi papamu na bhazee bha Izilaeli. Bhakachikimi ukupama palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, na bhakahighalili panihapa mbaka pakamihi, na bhakalijeghili luhombi mu mimutu jabhu kulangiha kubha bhatehi kuhakalila. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Yoshua akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, maghambu kike utulombwihi kuhuma kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, nahuli kutujeghela mu mabhoku gha Bhaamoli bhatuyonangaje? Ikabya mbanga tepani kuhighalila kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, henu mbwagha kike, anangati sajenu Bhaizilaeli bhatopuliki na adui bhabhu? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Bhela Bhakanaani papamu na bhenei bhokapi bha inchi jenjenu, pabhijowanaje malobhi ghanihagha, anabhatuyongalutaje na kulihungula lihina litu kuhuma panani ja ndema. Bho, henu anauhenga kike kwa ndandi ja lihina laku likolongwa?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ujemaje! Bho, mbona uchikimi ukutuma bhenibhela? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhahengiki mahoku, maghambu bhahekiti lulaghilu lwangu lonalaghalakili bhalukamulaje. Bhatoliki hindu yakumu yeyabhohakiki kwangu nepani nahuli iyonangikaje, bhajibhiki na kulongela upuhe, na kuibheka papamu na hindu yabhu bheni. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Jeniheji nde ndandi bhandu bha Izilaeli ngachebhaweza kujema palongi ja maadui bhabhu. Bhabhatila maadui bhabhu, maghambu bhalitendiki bheni kubha chindu cha kuyonangeka! Nganikubhi papamu na mwehapa kabhete, mbaka pamwiyonangaje kila chindu pachilanda jinu chekibhohakiki nahuli chiyonangikaje! <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Ujendaje, ukabhagholulaje bhandu. Ubhapwaghilaje, ‘Mligholulaje na kuliandaa kwa ndandi ja chilabhu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, apwagha anana: Pachilanda jinu pabhili na hindu yeyabhohakiki iyonangikaje, mwenga bhandu bha Izilaeli, ngamuwezi kujema palongi ja maadui bhinu, mbaka hindu yeniheyi ibhohakikaje pachilanda jinu.’ <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Bhela lukela mabhokapi mhikaje palongi jangu likabila kwa likabila. Likabila lela leanalihaghuliwaje na Bambo Chapanga, analipetaje palongi lukolu kwa lukolu. Lukolu loanaluhaghuliwaje na Bambo Chapanga, analupetaje palongi bhandu bha munyumba jimu kwa bhandu bha munyumba jimu. Na bhandu bha munyumba jimu bhabhihaghuliwaje na Bambo Chapanga, anabhapetaje palongi mundu kwa mundu. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Mundu jokapi joanahimaniwaje na hindu yeniheyi yeyabhohakiki nahuli iyonangikaje, anaajochakikaje kwa moto, jonihoju papamu na kila chindu chaki cheabhi nachu, maghambu ahekiti lulaghilu lwaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa kubha atendiki lijambu la iyoni mu Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Chilabhu jaki lukela pachibhombu Yoshua akabhaletiki Bhaizilaeli bhokapi pambipi jaki, likabila kwa likabila, na Bambo Chapanga akalihawili likabila la Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Kuhuma mu likabila laka Yuda, lukolu kwa lukolu lukapetiki palongi. Bambo Chapanga akaluhawili lukolu lwa Bhazela, na kuhuma mu lukolu lwa Bhazela, bhandu bha nyumba jimu kwa bhandu bha nyumba jimu bhakapetiki kulongi, nabhombi bhandu bha nyumba jaka Zabudi bhakahaghulike. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Yoshua akalaghalakili bhandu bha munyumba ja lukolu lwaka Zabudi kuhika kulongi mundu kwa mundu, najombi Akani mwana waka Kalimi, nchokolu waka Zabudi, mwana waka Zela, wa likabila laka Yuda, akahaghulike. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yoshua akumpwaghili Akani, “Mwanango, undumbalyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ukajetakyaje mahoku ghaku kwaki, na umbwaghilaje ghauhengike, wala ngawinhiya.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani akamuyangike, “Nde chakaka ndendiki mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. Haleli nde lijambu lendendike: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Panakaweni likanzu limu linyahi kuhuma ku Babeli, shekeli mia ibheli ya madini gha feza, mwihi wa zahabu ghoukabhili wa nusu kilu, nakaitokulili na kuitola. Lingalyaje, ihiyakiki pahi paluhombi mkati ja lihema langu, na madini gha feza hagha ghabhili pahi ja hindu yeniheyi.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Bhela Yoshua akabhatumiki bhabholu, nabhombi bhakakembili imbelu mbaka kulihema, lingalyaje, hindu yeniyela yakabhili ihiyakiki mulihema laki, papamu na madini gha feza ghala pahi jaki. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Bhakaitoliki hindu yela kuhuma mulihema, bhakundetili Yoshua papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, nabhombi bhakaibhekiki pahi, palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Bhela Yoshua papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, bhakuntoliki Akani mwana waka Zela, papamu na madini gha feza ghala, likanzu lela, mwihi wa zahabu ghola, bhana bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, ng'ombi, maponda, mambeleli ghaki, lihema laki papamu na hindu yokapi yekabhi nayu, na kuileta mbaka ku Libondi la Akoli, yani Libondi la Mang'ahiku. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yoshua akapwaghike, “Bho, maghambu kike uletiki mang'ahiku aghagha panani jito? Bambo Chapanga anaaletaje mang'ahiku panani jaku lalenu.” Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakundapwili Akani kwa maganga mbaka kupotela. Bhelabhela bhakabhalapwili bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaki kwa maganga mbaka kupotela, na kubhajocha kwa moto. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Bhela bhakabhongini maganga ghamaheli panani jaki, ambaghu ghabhili mbaka lalenu. Bhela kwa ndandi jeniheji lihina la pandu panipala pakalowakiki Libondi la Akoli, kutumbula lichobha leniheli, mbaka lalenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:26">Panihapa inyela ikali yaka Bambo Chapanga yakatumbile.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Muchi wa Ai utolakeka mateka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ngawijoghopa, wala ngawihekateka mtima. Ubhatolaje bhandu bhokapi bha ngondo na ujenda nabhu kuulapula muchi wa Ai, lingalyaje, nepani numbekiki nkolongwa wa Ai pahi ja lujiniku lwaku, papamu na bhandu bhaki, muchi waki na inchi jaki jokapi. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Utendilaje muchi wa Ai na nkolongwa waki ngati moukutendile muchi wa Yeliko na nkolongwa waki. Nambu muweza kutola mateka mali ghabhu papamu na hinyama yabhu ya kudimakika, kwa ndandi jinu mabhete. Ujendaje ukabhabhekaje bhandu bha kujobhalela ku upambala wa kunyuma wa muchi ghonihoghu.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Bhela, Yoshua akabhokiki, papamu na manjolinjoli bhaki bhokapi na kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Ai. Yoshua akabhahawili bhandu elufu selasini, bhandu bhabhakangamile nakanopi pachilanda jabhu, na kubhapwaghila bhalongulyaje chikahi cha ikilu. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Yoshua akabhalaghalakili, akapwaghaje, “Njowanyaje wichu ghanumpwaghila. Impalika kujobhalela kunyuma ja muchi. Ngamwijenda kutali nakanope na muchi ghonihoghu, nambu mabhokapi mkubhaje tayali kubhalapula. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Nepani papamu na bhandu bha ngondo bhabhabhili na nenga, anatuheghalya muchi, na chikahi bhandu pabhipitaje kunja nahuli kuhika kukomana na tepani, ngati mobhatendili pakutumbula hapa, tepani anatubhatilaje. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Anabhapita kunja kuhika kutulonda, mbaka patwikubha tubhahutike bhajenda kutali na muchi, maghambu anabhapwaghaje, ‘Bhatutila, ngati mobhatendili pakutumbula hapa.’ Natatu patwikubhaje tubhatila palongi jabhu, <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />panihapa mwehapa impalika njinukaje na kubhoka komulihiiki hoku, na kuutola mateka muchi. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaaujeghalaje muchi ghonihoghu pahi ja lujiniku lwinu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Pamwikubha muutoliki mateka muchi, muujochaje kwa moto. Ntendaje bhenibhela ngati Bambo Chapanga moandaghalakile. Ndingalyaje, impalika kughakamula mambu ghanundaghalakile.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Bhela, Yoshua akabhatumiki bhandu bhanihabha bhajendaje pandu pa kujobhalela, nabhombi bhakabhili bhajobhalela ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa muchi wa Ai, pachilanda ja muchi wa Beseli na Ai. Nambu Yoshua akaghonili ikilu jeniheji mu likambi la Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Yoshua akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu lichobha la kabheli, na kubhabhongana Bhaizilaeli kujenda ku muchi wa Ai, koni akabya papamu na bhazee bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Bhandu bhokapi bha ngondo bhabhakabhili papamu naku, bhakaheghalili na kuhika palongi ja muchi. Bhakabhekiki likambi ku upambala wa kungonde wa muchi wa Ai, napombi pakabhili na libondi pachilanda ja muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yoshua akabhili ajomwili kubhatola akanalomi ngati elufu nhwanu, na kubhabheka bhajobhalyaje pachilanda ja muchi wa Beseli na Ai, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa muchi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Bhela bhakabhapangiki bhandu na kubha tayali kwa ngondo, lipogha likolongwa la manjolinjoli lakabhekakiki ku upambala wa kungonde wa muchi wa Ai, na bhala bhabhahighalile bhabhakabhi bhandu bha kujobhalela bhakabhekakiki ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa muchi. Najombi Yoshua akapiti ikilu jeniheji pachilanda ja libondi leniheli. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Nkolongwa wa muchi wa Ai paakaweni lijambu leniheli, jombi papamu na bhandu bha muchi ghonighola bhakabhokiki manyata lukela pachibhombu, na kujenda kukomana ngondo na bhandu bha Izilaeli, kwa chikahi chechabhekakike, pambipi na libondi la nkoka Yoludani. Nambu ngacheakamanyi kubha kukabhili na bhandu bhabhajobhalile kunyuma ja muchi waki. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yoshua papamu na bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakalitendiki ngati bhatehi kulepalela palongi jabhu, na kutumbula kutilila kuchingwenje. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Bhandu bhokapi bha ngondo bhabhakabhili mkati ja muchi wa Ai bhakalowakiki bhalibhonganaje papamu, nahuli kubhajengalela Bhaizilaeli. Pabhakabhili bhunjengalela Yoshua, bhakabhokiki na kujenda kutali na muchi wabhu. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Njeta mwanalomi nga jumu joakahighalile mu muchi wa Ai, au mu muchi wa Beseli, jwangakubhajengalela Bhaizilaeli. Bhakajilekiki milyangu ja muchi lipala na kubhajengalela bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ujinulaje nkoha ghoubhili mu mabhoku ghaku na kulangiha ku muchi wa Ai, maghambu ananujeghalaje muchi ghonihoghu pahi ja lujiniku lwaku.” Panihapa Yoshua akalangihi nkoha ghoukabhili mu mabhoku ghaki ku upambala wa muchi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Chikahi pela Yoshua paakatehi bhenibhela, bhandu bhala bhabhakabhili bhajobhalile bhakabhokiki kuhuma pandu pabhajobhalile, bhakajingili mkati ja muchi manyata, na bhakatendiki manyata kuutola mateka muchi na kuujocha kwa moto. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Bhela chikahi bhandu bha muchi wa Ai pabhalingalili kunyuma, bhakaliweni lyohi kuhuma mu muchi lakakwelaje mbaka kunani kumahunde. Nabhombi ngachebhakabhili na uwezu wa kutilila ku upambala wokapi ghola, maghambu Bhaizilaeli bhabhakabhili bhatila kujenda ku chingwenji bhala, bhakang'anambwiki na kubhatopola bhandu bhala bhabhakabhi bhabhajengalela bhombi. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Bhela Yoshua na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhakaweni kubha bhandu bha kujobhalela bhala bhajomwili kuutola mateka muchi, na kubha lyohi lakabhili likwela kunani, panihapa bhakang'anambwiki, na kubhalapula bhandu bha ngondo bha muchi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Bhandu bhala bha kujobhalela bha Izilaeli nabhombi bhakapitiki kunja ja muchi kunyuma jabhu, bhela bhandu bha muchi wa Ai bhakaliweni bheni bhabhili pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli ipambala yokapi ibheli. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhakomiki bhandu bhokapi bha muchi wa Ai, panga kundeka hata mundu jumu kubha mwomi au joakalamike. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Nambu nkolongwa wa muchi wa Ai bhakuntoliki mateka koni akabya mwome, na kundeta kwaka Yoshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli pabhakajomwili kubhakoma akanalomi bhokapi bha muchi wa Ai mu mighonda na kuchingwenji kobhakabhi bhabhajengalela, na baada jaka kila jumu wabhu kukomakeka kwa lipanga, Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakakelawiki ku muchi wa Ai, na kubhakoma bhandu bhala bhabhakahighalili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Bhandu bhokapi bha muchi wa Ai, bhabhakomakiki mu lichobha leniheli bhakabhili akanalomi na akambonba ngati elufu komi na ibheli. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Kwa ndandi Yoshua ngacheahelihi chiwoku chaki chechikabhili chikamulakili nkoha kujenda ku upambala wa muchi wa Ai chela, mbaka paakajomwili kubhakoma bhandu bhokapi bha muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Nambu bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakatoliki hinyama na mali gha muchi ghonihoghu kubha yabhu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Yoshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Bhela Yoshua akaujochiki kwa moto muchi wa Ai, na kuutenda kubha lundu lwa mahame mbaka mileli, nawombi ubhili ukebha mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Bhela akunkomiki nkolongwa wa muchi wa Ai na kunhomeka panani ja nkongu na kundeka panipala mbaka pakamihe. Nambu chikahi lyobha palitumbulaje kujibhila, Yoshua akabhalaghalakili bhajibhohaje hyegha jaki panani ja nkongu na kujilekela pundyangu ukolongwa wa kujingalila mu muchi. Panihapa bhakalundiki maganga makolongwa ghamaheli panani ja ntuhi ghonihoghu, ambaghu ghahighalili panihapa mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia jisomakeka pa chitombi cha Ebali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Bhela Yoshua akachengiki chihanja cha kumbokeha nyambiku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, pa chitombi cha Ebali. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Yoshua akachengiki chihanja chenihechi, ngati Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, moakabhalaghalakili bhandu bha Izilaeli, ngati moilembakike mu chitabu cha Shelia jaka Musa, “Chihanja cha maganga ghangakuhongulewa, ambachu panani jaki njeta chombu cha choma chechitumike kulenganakela.” Panihapa nde pabhakumbokili nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwale. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Konihoku, palongi ja lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli, Yoshua akalembiki nakala ja Shelia jaka Musa panani ja maganga ghanihagha. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Bhaizilaeli bhokapi papamu na ihongozi bhabhu, bhazee na bhatemula na bhagheni bhokapi bhabhakabhili pachilanda jabhu, bhakajemiki kila upambala kulilingalila Lisanduku la Lulaghilu palongi ja bhapenganyambiku Bhalawi bhabhakabhili bhalitotwili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga. Nusu ja bhandu bhanihabha bhakajemiki palongi ja chitombi cha Gelizimu, na nusu jengi jakajemiki palongi ja chitombi cha Ebali, ngati Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, moakalaghalakile pakutumbula hapa kubhokana na malaghalakilu gha kubhapengalela bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Bhela, Yoshua akasomiki malobhi ghokapi gha Shelia, yani mbengalelu na masolu, ngati moilembakike mu Chitabu cha Shelia. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Yoshua akasomiki kila lilobhi la shelia palongi ja lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli, ngati moakalaghalakiwi na Musa. Akaghasomiki palongi ja bhandu bhokapi papanu na akambomba na bhana, na bhagheni bhokapi bhabhakabhili bhatama papamu nabhu.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Bhagibeoni bhunkolowa Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Bhakolongwa bhokapi bhabhakabhili bhatama ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani bhakajowini ushinde ghobhakapatiki bhandu bha Izilaeli. Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhakabhili bhatama ku pandu pa itombi, tutombi na ku uwanda wa Bahali ja Meditelania, mbaka ku Lebanoni ku upambala wa kungonde. Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhakabhili nde bhakolongwa bha Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhokapi bhakalombini papamu nahuli kukomana ngondo na Yoshua na bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Nambu bhenei bha ku Gibeoni, ambabhu nde Bhahivi, pabhajowini panani ja malobhi ghanihagha ghokapi Yoshua ghaakabhili abhahengile bhandu bha ku michi ja Yeliko na Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />bhombi bhakaamwili kunkolowa. Bhakalitendiki ngati bhabholu koni bhakabya na maponda ghabhu ghaghatotwile magunila ghaghalalike na mifuku ja divai jejilalike na jejilokakiki ilaka. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Mu magholu ghabhu bhakawati magubasi yeikachukine, ingobhu yeilalike, na chilebhi chabhu chakabhi mabumunda ghaghajomiki, na ghaghatumbwili kubha na chikongu. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Bhela bhakapiti kwaka Yoshua kulikambi ku Giligali kola, na kumpwaghila jombi papamu na bhandu bha Izilaeli, “Tuhuma ku inchi ja kutali, chondi tundobha ntendaje majetanganelu na tepani.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhapwaghili Bhahivi bhanihabha, “Pangi mtama pambipi na tepani, bho, tepani tuweza bholi kuhenga majetanganelu na mwehapa?”<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Nabhombi bhakumpwaghi Yoshua, “Tepani nde bhatumika bhaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Yoshua akabhalalukile, “Mwehapa nde akanane? Nanamu muhuma kwako?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Nabhombi bhakamuyangike, “Bhatumika bhaku tuhumiki ku inchi ja kutali namaa, na tuhikiki pambani maghambu tujowini malobhi gha lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na panani ja mambu ghokapi ghaakahengiki ku Misili hoku. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Bhelabhela tujowini mambu ghokapi ghaabhahengile bhakolongwa bhabheli bha Bhaamoli bhabhakabhili bhatama ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani. Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhakabhili Sihoni nkolongwa wa ku Heshiboni, na Ogu nkolongwa wa ku Bashani, joakabhili atawala ku Ashitaloti. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Bhela bhazee bhitu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhatama mu inchi jitu, bhakatupwaghili kubha tutolaje chilebhi kwa ndandi ja mwanja, na kuhika kuhimangana na mwehapa, na kumpwaghila kubha tepani nde bhatumika bhinu, chondi ntendaje majetanganelu na tepani. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Libumunda aleli lakabhili la moto chikahi patukabhili tulikonga kunyumba jitu, lichobha heli patukabhokiki kuhika pambani, nambu sajenu, lingalyaje, molijomile na ntundu molibhelili na chikongu. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Mifuku ajeji jakabhili jahenu chikahi patukatwelakili divai, nambu ulingalyaje ntundu mojitatukanile. Ingobhu hitu na magubasi ghitu ilaliki kwa ndandi ja mwanja ulachu wa kuhika pambane.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakakaghwili pandu pa ilebhi ya bhandu bhanihabha, panga kulalukila lilobhi kuhuma kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Panihapa Yoshua akatendiki majetanganelu gha lukwale papamu nabhu, nahuli kubhaleka bhajendalyaje kubha bhomi. Nabhombi ihongozi bha lipogha la Izilaeli bhakajetakili majetanganelu ghanihagha kwa kulapa.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Mu lichobha la katatu kutumbula pabhajomwi pela kuhenga majetanganelu nabhu, Bhaizilaeli bhakajowini kubha bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhili bhandu bha pambipi jabhu, na bhakabhili bhatama pambipi jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Bhela, Bhaizilaeli bhakatumbwili mwanja, na mu lichobha la katatu bhakahikiki ku michi ja bhandu bhanihabha. Michi jeniheji jakabhili Gibeoni, Kefila, Beeloti, na Kiliati Yealimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli ngachebhalapwili, maghambu ihongozi bha lipogha la Izilaeli bhakabhili bhajomwili kubhalapila kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. Panihapa lipogha lokapi lakang'ong'utiki panani ja ihongozi bha lipogha habha. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Nambu ihongozi bhokapi bha lipogha lenilela bhakabhayangiki bhandu, “Tujomwili kubhalapila kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, bhela ngachetuweza kubhagusa bhandu abhabha kwa sajenu. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Anatubhahengilaje lijambu aleli, anatubhalekaje bhajendalyaje kubha bhomi, nahuli ngatwihika kulapulika kwa ndandi ja kuheketa kulapa kotuhengike. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Ihongozi bhakajendalili kupwagha kubha bhabhalekaje bhatamaje, nambu bhakubhaje bhandu bha kuhala hanju na kuteka machi gha lipogha lokapi la Izilaeli.” Ngati ihongozi bha Izilaeli mobhakapwaghile.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Bhela Yoshua akabhalohiki Bhagibeoni na kubhalalukila, “Bho, maghambu kiki mwehapa mtehi kutukolowa, koni mkapwaghaje, ‘Tepani tutama kutali namaa na mwehapa.’ Na koni mwehapa mtama pambipi pela na tepani? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Bhela sajenu mwehapa mbili pahi ja masolu, chikahi chokapi anamkubhaje bhatumwa bha kuhala hanju na kuteka machi, kwa ndandi ja nyumba jaka Chapanga wangu.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Bhakamuyangiki Yoshua, “Bhatumika bhaku tukapwaghakiki kubha chakaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akundaghalakili mtumika waki Musa abhayonangaje bhenei bhokapi bhabhatama mu inchi jenjenu na kumpekeha mwehapa inchi jenjenu kubha jinu mabhete. Bhela tukabhili na choghoi namaa kwa ndandi ja matamu ghitu, kwa ndandi jinu mwehapa, nde ndandi tepani tuhengiki lijambu lendenu. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Bhela lingalyaje, tepani sajenu tubhili pahi ja lujiniku lwaku. Henu utuhengilaje lijambu lokapi lela leubhona wehapa kubha lamboni na lelipalika palongi jaku.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Bhela Yoshua akabhakengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha bhandu bha Izilaeli, nahuli ngabhikomakeka. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Nambu kutumbula lichobha leniheli, Yoshua akabhatendiki Bhagibeone kubha bhandu bha kuhala hanju na bhandu bha kuteka machi, kwa ndandi ja lipogha lokapi la Bhaizilaeli na kwa ndandi ja chihanja chaka Bambo Chapanga, pandu pala Bambo Chapanga paakapahawile, mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Bhaamoli bhalepalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Paghapetiki mambu ghanihagha Adoni Sedeki, nkolongwa wa Yelusalemu akajowini kubha Yoshua autoliki mateka muchi wa Ai na kuuyonanga nakanope, bhelabhela akabhili ankomiki nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu. Akahengiki bhenibhela ngati moakahengili ku muchi wa Yeliko na nkolongwa wa muchi hoghu. Kabhete bhandu bha ku Gibeoni bhakabhili bhahengiki majetanganelu gha kutama kwa lukwale na Bhaizilaeli, na kubha sajenu bhatama pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Malobhi ghanihagha ghakapelakili kubha na choghohi chikolongwa namaa kwa bhandu bha ku Yelusalemu hoku, maghambu Gibeoni ukabhili nde muchi ukolongwa pachilanda ja michi jejakabhili na bhakolongwa. Bhelabhela maghambu muchi aghoghu ukabhili ukolongwa kupeta muchi wa Ai, na bhandu bhaki bhokapi bhakabhili bhabhakangamili namaa kwa ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Bhela Adoni Sedeki, nkolongwa wa Yelusalemu akalobhiki ujangatilu kuhuma kwaka Hohamu, nkolongwa wa Hebuloni, kwaka Pilamu, nkolongwa wa Yalimuti, kwaka Yafia, nkolongwa wa Lakishi, na kwaka Debili, nkolongwa wa Egiloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />Akabhapwaghile, “Muhikaje mnyangatyaje kuulapula muchi wa Gibeoni, maghambu bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu bhahengiki majetanganelu gha kutama kwa lukwale na Yoshua na bhandu bha Izilaeli.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Bhela bhakolongwa nhwanu bha Bhaamoli, yani nkolongwa wa ku Yelusalemu, nkolongwa wa ku Hebuloni, nkolongwa wa ku Yalimuti, nkolongwa wa ku Lakishi na nkolongwa wa ku Egiloni, bhakalombanishi manjolinjoli ghabhu papamu, na kujenda naghu ku Gibeoni, bhakabhekiki likambi kuuyongolota muchi ghonihoghu, na kuulapula.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Bhela Bhagibeoni bhakatumiki ubholu kwaka Yoshua kulikambi ku Giligali, na kumpwaghila, “Chondi ngawatuleka tepani bhatumika bhaku. Ukwelaje manyata uhikaje kwitu koni kutukengalela! Utujangatyaje, maghambu bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Bhaamoli bhabhatama mu inchi ja itombi bhalombanishi manjolinjoli ghabhu na kuhika kutulapula!”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Bhela Yoshua akabhokiki ku Giligali papamu na manjolinjoli ghaki ghokapi, bhakabya na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakangamile kwa ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Yoshua, “Ngaubhajoghopa bhandu bhanihabha, maghambu nepani nyomwili kubhabheka pahi ja lujiniku lwaku. Njeta hata jumu wabhu joanawezaje kukushinda wehapa.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Bhela Yoshua akajendiki ikilu jokapi kuhuma ku Giligali, na kubhalapula Bhaamoli kwa kupwitukila. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Bambo Chapanga akabhajeghili Bhaamoli lujoghopu lukolongwa palongi ja Bhaizilaeli, nabhombi bhakaweziki kwa ushindi ukolongwa ku Gibeoni hoku. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhatopwili bhandu bhanihabha kujenda ku indela ja nhwelelu jejijenda ku Beti Holoni koni bhakabhakomaje mbaka kuhika ku indela jejijenda ku Azeka na Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Pabhakabhili bhatila palongi ja Bhaizilaeli ku indela jejijenda kunhwelelu wa Beti Holoni mbaka ku Azeka, Bambo Chapanga akabhahomili maganga gha balafu makolongwa kuhuma kunani kumahunde, na bhamaheli bhabhu bhakakomakiki kwa maganga ghanihagha kupeta bhandu bhala bhabhakomakiki kwa mapanga gha Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Mu lichobha lela Bambo Chapanga paakabhajeghili Bhaamoli mu mabhoku gha Bhaizilaeli, Yoshua akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga palongi ja mihu gha Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, akapwaghaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Wenga lyobha, ujemaje chinunu panani ja Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">wenga lubhalamwehi, ujemaje panani ja Libondi la Aiyaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Bhela lyobha lakajemiki chinunu, na lubhalamwehi lukajemiki mbaka bhandu bha Izilaeli pabhajomwili kulepa kisasi kwa maadui bhaki. Bho, mambu ghanihagha le ngacheghalembakiki mu chitabu cha Yashali? Bhela lyobha lakajemiki chinunu pachilanda ja mbengu, wala ngachelajombatiki manyata kujibhila kwa lichobha limu. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Lichobha ngati leniheli ngachelilabhali kubha mangani ja panihapa, au palongi ja machobha ghanihagha, lichobha ambalu Bambo Chapanga akajowanili sauti jaka mundu ngati anana. Ndandi chakaka Bambo Chapanga akabhili abhakomanela bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Bhela Yoshua akakelawiki kulikambi ku Giligali hoku, papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua abhakoma bhakolongwa nhwanu bha Bhaamoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Bhela bhakolongwa nhwanu bhala bhakatiliki, na kujenda kujobhalela mkati ja limbaku la ku Makeda hoku. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Yoshua paakapwaghakiki kubha bhakolongwa nhwanu habha bhahimaniwi bhakabya bhajobhalile mkati ja limbaku la ku Makeda hoku, <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yoshua akapwaghike, “Mughahingalyaje maganga makolongwa pundomu wa limbaku leniheli, bhelabhela mbekaje bhalonda pandu panihapa. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Nambu mwehapa ngamwitama konihoku. Mubhajengalyaje adui bhinu, na kubhalapula kuhumila kunyuma, wala ngamubhaleka bhahikaje mu michi jabhu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhajeghili bhandu bhanihabha mumabhoku ghinu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Bhela Yoshua papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhakabhalapwili na kubhayonanga bhandu bhamaheli namaa, na bhachokopi bhabhakahighalile bhakatilili ku michi jabhu jejikabhili na lumatu. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha bhandu bhokapi bhakakelawiki lukwali kwaka Yoshua kulikambi la ku Makeda hoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:21">Njeta mundu hata jumu joakalongile lilobhi lokapi lela panani ja bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Bhela Yoshua akapwaghike, “Henu, mbohaje maganga gha pundyangu wa limbaku leniheli, na mnetilaje bhakolongwa nhwanu habha kunja ja limbaku koni.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Panihapa bhakabhapihiki bhakolongwa nhwanu habha kunja ja limbaku, yani nkolongwa wa Yelusalemu, nkolongwa wa Hebuloni, nkolongwa wa Yalimuti, nkolongwa wa Lakishi na nkolongwa wa Egiloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Pabhakabhili bhabhaletiki bhakolongwa nhwanu habha kwaka Yoshua, Yoshua akabhalohiki bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, na kubhapwaghila manjolinjoli bhakolongwa bha ngondo bhabhakapiti papamu naku, “Muhikaje pambani mbekaje lwaju hinu panani ja hingu ya bhakolongwa abhabha.” Panihapa bhakahikiki na kubheka lwaju yabhu panani ja hingu ya bhakolongwa bhanihabha. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yoshua akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwijoghopa, wala ngamwihekateka mtima. Mkubhaje na makili na mkangamalaje. Maghambu aleli nde Bambo Chapanga leanaabhahengilaje adui bhinu bhokapi bhanjenda kukomana nabhu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Bhela, Yoshua akabhalapwili na kubhakoma bhakolongwa nhwanu bhala, na kuhomeka mituhi jabhu panani ja mikongu nhwanu, na kubhaleka pandu panipala koni bhajenjela mbaka pakamihe.<verse eid="JOS 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Chikahi lyobha palakabhili pambipi kujibhila, Yoshua akalaghalakili bhabhohakikaje panani ja mikongu pabhakabhili bhajenjela na kubhalekela mu limbaku lela lebhakabhili bhajobhalile. Bhela pundyangu wa limbaku leniheli bhakabhekiki maganga makolongwa ambaghu ghabhili mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua ajitola mateka michi jengi ja Bhaamoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Lichobha lela Yoshua paakautoliki mateka muchi wa Makeda, akunkomiki nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu kwa lipanga na bhandu bhaki bhokapi panga kundeka mundu hata jumu. Akuntendili nkolongwa wa ku Makeda ngati moakuntendile nkolongwa wa ku Yeliko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Bhela Yoshua akabhokiki kuhuma ku Makeda akabya papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli mbaka ku muchi wa Libina, na kuulapula. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga akaubhekiki muchi ghonihoghu wa Libina papamu na nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu pahi ja lujiniku lwa bhandu bha Izilaeli. Yoshua akauyoningi muchi ghonighola na kila mundu joakabhili mkati jaki kwa lipanga, panga kunhighakila mundu hata jumu mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu. Akuntendili nkolongwa wa Libina ngati moakuntendile nkolongwa wa Yeliko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Bhela Yoshua akabhokiki ku muchi wa Libina, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, na kujenda mbaka ku Lakeshi, bhakauyongalwiti na kuulapula muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Bambo Chapanga akaubhekiki muchi ghonihoghu wa Lakishi pahi ja lujiniku lwa bhandu bha Izilaeli, najombi Yoshua akautoliki mateka mu lichobha la kabheli. Joashua akauyoningi muchi ghonihoghu na kila chindu chechikabhili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu kwa lipanga, ngati moakautendile muchi wa Libina. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Chikahi chenihechi, Holamu nkolongwa wa Gezeli akakweliki nahuli kujenda kubhajangatila bhandu bha Lakishi, nambu Yoshua akundapwili jombi na bhandu bhaki, panga kunhighakila mundu hata jumu.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Bhela Yoshua akabhokiki ku muchi wa Lakishi na kujenda ku muchi wa Egiloni, akabhili papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli. Bhakauyongalwiti muchi ghonihoghu na kuulapula. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Bhakautoliki mateka muchi ghonihoghu mu lichobha lela lela, bhakaulapwili kwa lipanga na kumuyonanga kila mundu joakabhili mkati jaki, ngati moakautendile muchi wa Lakishi.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Bhela Yoshua papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, bhakakweliki kuhuma ku muchi wa Egiloni na kujenda ku muchi wa Hebuloni, na kuulapula muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Bhakautoliki mateka na kuulapula kwa lipanga, papamu na nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu, ijiji yaki, na kila mundu joakabhili mkati jaki. Njeta mundu hata jumu joakahighalili mkati jaki, ngati mobhakautendile muchi wa Egiloni. Bhakauyoningi nakanopi papamu na kila mundu joakabhili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Bhela Yoshua papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, bhakakelawiki kujenda ku muchi wa Debili, na kuulapula muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Bhakautoliki mateka muchi ghonihoghu, nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu, ijiji yaki, na kuulapula kwa lipanga. Bhakamuyoningi kila mundu joakabhili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu, panga kunhighakila mundu hata jumu. Bhakautendili muchi wa Debili na nkolongwa waki, ngati moakatendile ku michi ja Libina na Hebuloni, na bhakolongwa bhabhu.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Bhela Yoshua akajitoliki mateka inchi jeniheji jokapi, jakabyaje papamu na inchi ja itombi, pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache, na pandu pa uwanda wa ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, na mihelelu ja itombi, papamu na bhakolongwa bhaki bhokapi. Ngacheakahighalili mundu hata jumu, nambu akayoningi nakanopi kila chindu chechibhili na mbomu, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, moakalaghalakile. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yoshua akabhalapwili bhandu bhokapi kutumbula ku Kadeshi Belinea mbaka ku Gaza, na kuhuma ku inchi ja Gosheni mbaka ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhokapi papamu na inchi yabhu, Yoshua akabhashindiki kwa chikahi chimu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, akabhakomanili bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Panihapa Yoshua akakelawiki papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli, mbaka ku likambi labhu ku Giligali hoku.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua andapula nkolongwa Yabini na bhakolongwa bhangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Bhela Yabini, nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Hazoli, paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha gha kushinda kwa Bhaizilaeli, akatumiki ubholu wa kupala kulombana kwa ndandi ja kukomana na Bhaizilaeli kwa bhakolongwa bhabhunhyongolota. Akatumiki ubholu kwaka Yobabu, nkolongwa wa Madoni, kwaka nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Shimiloni, kwaka nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Akishafu, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />na bhelabhela kwa bhakolongwa bha ku itombi ya ku upambala wa kungonde, na ku pandu pa Alaba upambala wa kunkachi wa Kineleti, ku uwanda, na ku inchi yeibhili kundonda ya Nafoti Doli ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />bhelabhela akapeliki ubholu kwa Bhakanaani upambala wa kolipita lyobha na kolijibhi lyobha, na kwa Bhaamoli, Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, na Bhayebusi ku inchi ja itombi, na kwa Bhahivi pahi ja chitombi cha Helimoni mu inchi ja Misipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Bhela bhakapitiki kunja bhokapi na mapogha makolongwa gha manjolinjoli ghabhu, bhandu bhamaheli namaa ngati luhanga lolubhili mumaheku ja bahali, papamu na falasi na magali ghabhu gha kuhutakika gha ngondo ghamaheli namaa. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhokapi bhakalombanishi manjolinjoli ghabhu na kubheka likambi labhu papamu pa machi gha Melomu, nahuli kukomana na bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ngaubhajoghopa bhanihabha, maghambu chilabhu chikahi ngati chenjenu, ananabhayonangaje bhokapi kwa kubhabheka pahi ja lujiniku lwa bhandu bha Izilaeli. Wihekataje mihipa ja kunyuma ja magholu gha falasi yabhu, na magali ghabhu gha kuhutakika gha ngondo ughajochaje kwa moto.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Bhela Yoshua akapiti papamu na bhandu bhokapi bha ngondo, nahuli kukomana nabhu pa machi gha Melomu, na kubhalapula kwa kupwitukila. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Bambo Chapanga akabhabhekiki pahi ja lujiniku lwa bhandu bha Izilaeli, nabhombi bhakabhalapwili, na kubhatopola mbaka ku Sidoni muchi ukolongwa, na kuhika mbaka ku Misilefoti Maimu, mbaka ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa libondi la Misipa. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhalapwili bhokapi wala ngacheakahighalili mundu hata jumu. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yoshua akabhahengili bhelabhela ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile. Akahekiti mihipa ja kunyuma ja magholu gha falasi yabhu, na magali ghabhu gha kuhutakika gha ngondo akaghajochiki kwa moto.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Chikahi chenihechi Yoshua akakelawiki, na kuutola mateka muchi wa Hazoli, na kunkoma nkolongwa wa muchi ghonihoghu kwa lipanga. Hazoli ukabhili nde muchi ukolongwa wa ngolongwa yeniheyi yokapi. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Kila mundu joakabhili mkati ja muchi ghonihoghu wa Hazoli bhakunkomiki kwa lipanga. Bhakabhayoningi nakanope, ngachebhunhighakili mundu jokapi jola kubha mwomi, na bhakaujochiki muchi wa Hazoli hoghu kwa moto.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Yoshua akajitoliki mateka michi jeniheji jokapi ja kikolongwa, papamu na bhakolongwa bhaki, na kubhakoma bhokapi kwa lipanga. Akabhayoningi bhokapi nakanope, ngati Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Nambu bhandu bha Izilaeli ngachebhajochiki moto hata ghumu wa michi jejachengakiki ku itombi yabhu ichoku ichoku, nambu muchi wa Hazoli pela ambau Yoshua akaujochiki kwa moto. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Bhaizilaeli bhakaitoliki hindu yokapi yebhakaitoliki mateka papamu na hinyama ya michi jeniheji, nambu bhakabhakomiki bhenei bhokapi bha michi jeniheji, panga kunhighakila mundu hata jumu kujendalela kupomola. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Musa mtumika waki, bhenibhela nde Musa moakundaghalakile Yoshua, najombi Yoshua akahengiki bhenibhela. Yoshua ngecheakakotwiki kuhenga lijambu lokapi lela pachilanda ja ghokapi ghala Bambo Chapanga ghaakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inchi yeakaitoliki mateka Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Yoshua akajitoliki mateka inchi jokapi: Inchi ja itombi, na inchi jokapi ja tutombi, ku upambala wa kungonde na kunkache, pandu pokapi pa Gosheni, pandu pajomu pa upambala wa kunkache, papamu na libondi la nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Akabhatoliki mateka na kubhakoma bhakolongwa bhokapi bha inchi yeniheyi, kutumbula chitombi cha Halaki pambipi na Seili mbaka ku Baali Gadi ku libondi la Lebanoni, kunkachi ja chitombi cha Helimoni. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Ngondo jebhakomini Yoshua na bhakolongwa abhabha bhokapi jakabhili kwa chikahi chilachu. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Njeta muchi ghoukahengiki majetanganelu gha lukwali na bhandu bha Izilaeli, nambu Bhahivi bhabhakabhili bhatama ku Gibeoni pela. Bhaizilaeli bhakajitoliki mateka michi jengi jokapi kwa kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga mweni nde joakajitendiki mitima jabhu kubha ja kunonopa, nahuli bhakomanaje ngondo na bhandu bha Izilaeli, nahuli apataje kubhayonanga bhokapi panga chiha, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Chikahi chenihechi Yoshua akapiti kubhayonanga Bhaanaki bhabhakabhili bhatama ku inchi ja itombi, kutumbula ku Hebuloni, Debili, Anabu, inchi jokapi ja itombi ya Yuda na inchi jokapi ja itombi ya Izilaeli. Yoshua akabhayongiki bhokapi nakanopi na michi jabhu jokapi. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Ngachebhahighalili Bhaanaki hata jumu mu inchi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli, nambu bhakahighalili pela ku michi ja Gaza, Gati na ku Ashidodi.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Bhela Yoshua akajitoliki mateka inchi jeniheji jokapi ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Musa. Najombi Yoshua akabhapekihi Bhaizilaeli inchi jeniheji kubha upwelelu wabhu, kulengana na mobhaghabhanile mu makabila ghabhu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Bhela inchi jakabhili na lukwali panga kubha na ngondo kabhete.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Bhakolongwa bhabhalapuliki na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bha nchi ambayu Bhaizilaeli bhakabhili bhabhashindiki na kutawala inchi yabhu upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, kutumbula ku libondi la nkoka Alinoni mbaka ku chitombi cha Helimoni, papamu na inchi jokapi ja libondi la nkoka Yoludani ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha: <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Sihoni nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, akabhili atama ku Heshiboni, najombi nde joakatawile kutumbula ku muchi wa Aloeli ghoubhili pambipi na ukengu wa libondi la Alinoni, kutumbula pachilanda ja libondi mbaka ku nkoka wa Yaboki, ambau nde malindakanilu gha inchi ja Bhaamoni, yani mbaka nusu ja inchi ja Gileadi. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Bhelabhela akatawili inchi jokapi ja libondi la nkoka Yoludani, kutumbula ku bahali ja Kineati, upambala wa kolipita lyobha, mbaka ku bahali ja Alaba, yani bahali ja Mwinyu, mbaka ku Beti Yeshimoti, kujenda mbaka kunkachi ja mihelelu ja Pisiga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Jongi akabhili Ogu, nkolongwa wa Bashani, joakabhili jumu wa mahighalilu gha Bhalefai, joakatawili ku Ashitaloti na ku Edilei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Jonihoju akatawili ku chitombi cha Helimoni, ku muchi wa Sekela, ku Bashani jokapi mbaka ku malindakanilu gha bhandu bha Geshuli, na bhandu bha Maaka, na nusu ja Gileadi, mbaka ku malindakanilu ghaka Sihoni, nkolongwa wa muchi wa Heshiboni.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, papamu na Bhaizilaeli akabhaweziki bhakolongwa bhabheli habha, na kughapekeha makabila ghaka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase inchi ja bhakolongwa bhanihabha nahuli jikubhaje upwelelu wabhu.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakolongwa bhabhalapuliki na Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Abhabha nde bhakolongwa ambabhu Yoshua papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhakabhashindiki pandu pokapi papabhili ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha ja nkoka Yoludani, kutumbula ku Baali Gadi ku libondi la Lebanoni mbaka ku chitombi cha Halaki, ku upambala wa kunkachi pambipi na Seili. Yoshua akabhaghabhili bhandu bha Izilaeli inchi jeniheji kubhokana na makabila ghabhu nahuli jikubhaje upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Inchi yeniheyi yakabhili inchi ja itombi, inchi ja tutombi ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, pandu pa libondi la nkoka Yoludani, mihelelu ja itombi, pandu pa chingwenje, pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache. Bhandu bhabhakabhili bhatama konihoku bhakabhili Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhalapwili bhakolongwa abhabha: Nkolongwa wa ku Yeliko jumu, na nkolongwa wa Ai, ghoubhili pambipi na Beteli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />nkolongwa wa Yelusalemu, jumu, nkolongwa wa Hebuloni, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />nkolongwa wa Yalimuti, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Lakishi, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />nkolongwa wa Egiloni, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Gezeli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />nkolongwa wa Debili, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Gedeli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />nkolongwa wa Holima, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Aladi, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />nkolongwa wa Libina, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Adulamu, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />nkolongwa wa Makeda, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Beseli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />nkolongwa wa Tapua, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Hefeli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />nkolongwa wa Afeka, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Lashaloni, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />nkolongwa wa Madoni, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Hazoli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />nkolongwa wa Shimiloni Meloni, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Akishafu, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />nkolongwa wa Taanaki, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Megido, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />nkolongwa wa Kedeshi, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Yokineamu ghoubhili ku chitombi cha Kalimeli, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />nkolongwa wa Doli ghoubhili ku chitombi cha Nafoti Doli, jumu, na nkolongwa wa Goimu ghoubhili ku Giligali, jumu, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />na nkolongwa wa Tiliza, jumu. Bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhokapi bhakabhili selasini na jumu.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pangi pa Kanaani papakabhili pakali ngakutolakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Bhela Yoshua paakabhili akongapili, na kubha na hyaka yamaheli, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Wehapa ukongapili namaa, na ubhili na hyaka yamaheli, na kukali kubhili na inchi yamaheli namaa ambayu yakali ngachwitolakike. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Ayeyi nde inchi yeihighalile: Inchi jokapi ja Bhafilisti na inchi jokapi ja Bhageshuli. <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />Kutumbula chikoka cha Shiholi chekibhili ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Misili, kujenda mbaka kungonde ja pandu pa Ekiloni, inchi jejimanyikana kubha nde ja Bhakanaani. Pandu pokapi pa bhakolongwa bha Bhafilishi, Bhagaza, Bhaashidodi, Bhashikeloni, Bhagiti, Bhaekiloni, na Bhaavi. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Kukabhili na Bhakanaani bhangi bhabhakabhili bhakali kutama ku upambala wa kunkachi, kutumbula ku Meala ja Bhasidoni, mbaka ku Afeka, mu malindakanilu gha Bhaamoli, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />na inchi jokapi ja Bhagebali na Lebanoni, ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Baali Gadi ghoubhili pahi ja chitombi cha Helimoni mbaka kuhika Lebo Hamati. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />Bhandu bhokapi bhabhatama ku itombi yeibhili kutumbula ku Lebanoni mbaka ku Miselefoti Maimu, papamu na pandu pokapi pa Bhasidoni, nepani namwete ananabhatopulaje bhandu bhanihabha bhabhokaje palongi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli. Nambu wehapa ikupalika kubhaghabhila inchi jenjenu bhandu bha Izilaeli kubha upwelelu wabhu, ngati monukulaghalakile. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Bhela sajenu, ubhaghabhilaje inchi yeniheyi makabila tisa na nusu ja likabila laka Manase kubha upwelelu wabhu.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughabhana pandu pa upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase bhakapekiwi upwelelu wabhu ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Musa, mtumika waki. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Pandu pabhu pakabhili kutumbula ku Aloeli mu ukengu wa nkoka wa Alinoni na muchi ghola ghoubhili pachilanda ja libondi, na inchi jokapi ja uwanda kutumbula ku Madeba mbaka ku Didoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />Papamu na michi jokapi jaka Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, joakatawili ku Heshiboni, mbaka ku malindakanilu gha Bhaamoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Papamu na inchi yokapi ya Gileadi, pandu pa Bhageshuli na Bhamaaka, chitombi chokapi cha Helimoni, na Bashani jokapi mbaka ku Seleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />yani ukolongwa wokapi waka Ogu jumu wa Bhalefai bhabhakahighalile, ambaju akatawili ku Ashitaloti na Edeli, mu Bashani. Musa akabhili abhaweziki bhanihabha bhokapi na kubhatopulela kutali. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Hata bhela, Bhaizilaeli ngachebhatopwili Bhageshuli, wala Bhamaaka, nambu Bhageshuli na Bhamaaka bhejendalela kutama pachilanda ja bhandu bha Izilaeli mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Nambu Musa ngacheabhapekihi bhandu bha likabila la Bhalawi upwelelu wokapi ghola kubha wabhu. Nambu nyambiku yebhakumbokihe Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli kwa moto, yeniheyi nde yakabhili upwelelu wabhu, ngati moakumpwaghi Musa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu paakapekiwi Leubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Apapa nde pandu ambapu Musa akabhapekihi bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni kubha upwelelu wabhu kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Pandu pabhu pakabhili kutumbula ku Aloeli ghoubhili pambipi na ukengu wa nkoka wa Alinoni, na muchi ghouyongolota nkoka ghonihoghu, papamu na inchi jokapi ja uwanda ghoubhili pambipi na Madeba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Mbaka ku Heshiboni papamu na michi jaki jokapi jejibhili ku uwanda, na Diboni, Bamoti Baali, Beti Baali Meoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />na Yahasa, Kedemoti, Mefaati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />na Kiliataimu, Sibima, Seleti Shahali ku chitombi chechibhili mu libondi, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />na Beti Peoli, mihelelu ja chitombi cha Pisiga, Beti Yeshimoti, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />na michi jokapi ja uwanda, inchi jokapi jaka nkolongwa Sihoni wa Bhaamoli joakatawili ku Heshiboni hoku. Musa akabhili amuweziki Sihoni, papamu na bhatawala bha Bhamidiani, ambabhu nde Evi, Lekemu, Suli, Huli na Leba, bhabhakalombini na Sihoni, ambabhu bhakabhili bhatama mu inchi jenijela. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Balaamu najombi, yani mwana waka Beoli joakabhili nhwabhi, Bhaizilaeli bhakunkomiki kwa lipanga pachilanda ja bhandu bhangi bhabhakomakike. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Malindakanilu gha inchi ja likabila laka Leubeni ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha ukabhili nkoka Yoludani. Michi jeniheji na ijiji yaki yokapi nde yeyakabhili upwelelu wa likabila laka Leubeni, kulengana na lukolu yabhu.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu paakapekiwi Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Apapa nde pandu ambapu Musa akabhapekihi likabila laka Gadi, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Malindakanilu ghabhu ghakabhi nde inchi ja Yazeli, michi jokapi ja Gileadi na nusu ja inchi ja Bhaamoni, mbaka ku Aloeli ghoubhili ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Laba, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />na kutumbula ku Heshiboni mbaka ku Lamati Misipa na Betonimu, na kutumbula ku Mahanaimu mbaka ku malindakanilu gha Lodebali. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Bhelabhela michi jejibhili mu libondi la nkoka Yoludani jakabhili Beti Halamu, Beti Nimila, Sukoti na Zafani na inchi jejakabhili jaka nkolongwa Sihoni wa ku Heshiboni, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, na ku upambala wa kunkache malindakanilu gha bahali ja Kineleti. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Michi jeniheji na ijiji yaki yakabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Gadi, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inchi jebhakapekiwi nusu ja likabila laka Manase upambala wa kolipita lyobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Apapa nde pandu ambapu Musa akabhapekihi nusu ja likabila laka Manase kubha upwelelu wabhu, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Pandu pabhu pakajaghanili kutumbula ku Mahanaimu, Bashani jokapi, yani ukolongwa wokapi waka Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani, papamu na ijiji sitini ya Yaili, ku Bashani hoku. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Papamu na nusu ja Gileadi, na Ashitaloti na Edeli, jejakabhili pahi ja utawala waka Ogu mu Bashani. Pandu panihapa bhakapekiwi nusu ja bhabhelakeka bhaka Makili mwana waka Manase, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Ghonihoghu nde upwelelu ambau Musa akabhaghabhili mu inchi ja uwanda wa Moabu, kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani, ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Yeliko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Nambu kwa likabila la Bhalawi, Musa ngacheabhapekihi upwelelu wokapi ghola, maghambu akabhapwaghili kubha upwelelu wabhu nde nyambiku ya kujochakeka yebhibhohaje kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Kughabhanika kwa inchi ja Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Apapa nde pandu pa inchi ambapu bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakapatoliki mu inchi ja Kanaani, ambayu Eleazali mpenganyambiku, na Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, papamu na ihongozi bha lukolu ya makabila gha Izilaeli, bhakabhaghabhile. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Pandu pabhu hapa bhakapaghabhiki kwa kulapula kula ja upwelelu wabhu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa abhapekyaje makabila tisa na nusu ghala. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Maghambu Musa akajomwili kubhapekeha makabila ghabheli na nusu ghala upwelelu wabhu ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, nambu Bhalawi ngachebhapekiwi upwelelu pachilanda ja bhajabhu. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu bhakabhili makabhila ghabheli, Manase na Efulaimu. Bhalawi ngachebhapatiki pandu pokapi pala pa inchi, nambu bhakapekiwi pela michi ja kutama, na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama yabhu ya kudimakika na liziki yabhu. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Bhela, Bhaizilaeli bhakaghabhini inchi jenijela, ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebu apekekewa muchi wa Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Lichobha limu bhandu bha likabila la Yuda bhakunjendili Yoshua ku Giligali hoku. Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, joakabhili wa lukolu lwaka Kenizi, akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Wehapa umanyi lilobhi lela Bambo Chapanga leakumpwaghi Musa, mundu waka Chapanga hoju, kwa ndandi jangu nepani na wehapa, chikahi patukabhili ku Kadeshi Balinea. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Panakabhili na umuli wa hyaka alobaini, Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, akandumiki kuhuma ku Kadeshi Belinea na kujenda kujipeleleza inchi jeniheje. Nanatu nakundetili malobhi kulengana na monabhonile muntima wangu. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Nambu bhalongu bhangu bhabhakweliki papamu na nepani bhakajitendiki mitima ja bhandu kuhekateka kwa choghohi chikolongwa, nambu nepani nakunjengalili Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, kwa mtima wokapi. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Bhela mu lichobha lenilela, Musa akanapile, ‘Chakaka inchi jela jeujikanyiti kwa magholu ghaku anajikubhaje upwelelu waku wehapa, na bhana bhaku mileli, maghambu unjengalili Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, kwa mtima wokapi.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Nambu sajenu, lingalyaje! Nde chikahi cha hyaka alobaini na nhwanu kutumbula Bambo Chapanga paakalongili na Musa, chikahi Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhili bhapeta mulipololu. Bhela kutumbula chikahi chenihechi mbaka lalenu, nepani mili na umuli wa hyaka semanini na nhwanu. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Nambu nakali mili na makili ngati lichobha lela Musa paakandumike. Ngati makili ghangu moghabhelile chikahi chenihechi, nde moghabhelile sajenu. Mili na makili gha kujenda kungondo sajenu ngati monabhelile chikahi chenichela. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Bhela sajenu nukulobha umbekyaje inchi ajeji ja itombi, ambaju Bambo Chapanga akanaghili lichobha lela. Maghambu wehapa wamwete ukajowini lichobha lela Bhaanaki mobhakabhelili konihoku, na michi jabhu mojabhelili mikolongwa na jejichengakiki lumatu, Bambo Chapanga, anaanyangatile, ananabhatopulaje bhokapi bhabhokaje monihomu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Bhela Yoshua akumpengalili Kalebu mwana waka Yefune, na kumpekeha pandu pa muchi wa Hebuloni kubha upwelelu waki. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Bhela muchi wa Hebuloni ubhili pandu paka Kalebu mwana waka Yefune, wa lukolu lwaka Kenizi, mbaka lalenu. Maghambu akabhili ndongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, kwa mtima waki wokapi. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Pakutumbula hapa muchi wa Hebuloni ukalowakiki Kiliati Aliba, Aliba akabhili mundu nkolongwa kupeta bhandu bhokapi pachilanda ja Bhaanaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Bhela inchi jokapi jakabhili na lukwali panga kubha na ngondo.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Pandu pa inchi jebhakapekiwi kwa kulapula kula bhandu bha likabila la Yuda, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu, pakajaghanili kutumbula ku upambala wa kunkachi na kolipita lyobha mbaka ku malindakanilu gha Edomu. Ku pandu pa kunkachi nakanopi kukabhili na lipololu la Sini. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Ulindakanilu wabhu wa kunkachi ukatumbulili mu chimbundi chechibhili ku kunkachi ja Bahali ja Mwinyu, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />ukajendalili kunkachi ja indela ja Akilabimu, na kujenda mbaka ku Sini, na ku upambala wa kunkachi wa Kadeshi Belinea. Bhelabhela ukapetili ku Hesiloni, na kukwela mbaka ku Adali, na kuyongolota kujenda mbaka ku Kalika. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Kuhuma panihapa ukajendalili mbaka ku Azimoni na kulombaneka na kikoka cha Misili, na kujomukela ku bahali ja Meditelania. Ghonihoghu ukabhili nde ulindakanilu wabhu wa upambala wa kunkachi wa likabila la Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Ulindakanilu wa upambala wa kolipita lyobha ukabhili nde Bahali ja Mwinyu, na kujendalela mbaka pandu pala nkoka Yoludani paujingalila mubahali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:5">Ulindakanilu wa upambala wa kungonde ukatumbulili pa chimbundi cha Bahali ja Mwinyu pandu ambapu nkoka Yoludani ujingalila mubahali. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukapetiki mbaka ku Beti Hogila, na kujendalela kungonde ja Beti Alaba mbaka ku liganga la Bohani, mwana waka Leubeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kuhuma panihapa, ulindakanilu ukajendalili mbaka ku Debili, kuhuma ku libondi la Akoli na kungonde kujenda mbaka ku Giligali, ghoubhili pambipi na indela ja kujenda ku Adumimu, ghoubhili kunkachi ja nkoka. Bhela ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukajendalili mbaka ku chemuchemu ja machi gha Eni Shemeshi na kujomukela ku Eni Logeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Bhela ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukapetiki mbaka ku libondi la Hinomu, upambala wa kunkachi wa nhwelelu wa muchi ukolongwa wa Bhayebusi, yani Yelusalemu. Kuhuma panihapa ukajendalili mbaka kunani ja chitombi chechibhili ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa libondi la Hinomu na kuhika mbaka ku ujomukelu wa libondi la Bhalefai, ku upambala wa kungonde. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kuhuma panani ja chitombi chenihechi, ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukajendalili mbaka ku chemuchemu ja machi gha Nefitoa, na kupitalila mbaka ku muchi wa chitombi cha Efuloni, na kuhelela kujenda ku Baala, yani Kiliati Yealimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Kuhuma panihapa ulindakanilu ukayongalwiti kuhuma ku Baala mbaka ku chitombi cha Seili, ukapetiki kungonde ja chitombi cha Yelimu, yani Kesaloni, na kuhelela mbaka ku Beti Shemeshi ambapu ukapetiki pambipi na Timuna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Bhela ukajendalili upambala wa kungonde ja Ekiloni ukalyongaliti kujenda ku Shikiloni ambapu ukapetiki pambipi na chitombi cha Baala, na kupitalila ku muchi wa Yabineeli. Ukatemi mu Bahali ja Meditelania. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Ulindakanilu wa kolijibii lyoba ukabhili mu maheku ja bahali ja Meditelania.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:12">Ghanihagha ghakabhili nde malindakanilu gha bhandu bha likabila la Yuda kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhaka Kalebu bhajitola mateka michi ja Hebuloni na Debili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JDG 1:11-15">Bhaamuzi 1:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Kalebu mwana waka Yefune, akapekiwi pandu pa inchi jaka Yuda ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Yoshua. Akapekiwi Kiliati Aliba au muchi waka Aliba ambaju akabhili hokolu waka Anaki. Muchi ghonihoghu sajenu ulowakeka Hebuloni. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kuhuma ku muchi wa Hebuloni, Kalebu akabhatopwili lukolu itatu yaka Anaki, yani lukolu lwaka Sheshai, lukolu lwaka Ahimani na lukolu lwaka Talimai. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kuhuma ku Hebuloni akakweliki kujenda kubhalapula bhenei bha muchi wa Debili, lihina la Debili pakutumbula hapa ukalowakiki Kiliati Sefeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kalebu akapwaghike, “Ananuntoghukyaje mwali wangu Akisa kwaka mwanalomi jokapi jola joanautolaje mateka muchi wa Kiliati Sefeli.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Bhela Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi, ndongu waka Kalebu, akautoliki mateka muchi ghonihoghu, panihapa Kalebu akuntoghukili Akisa mwali waki kwaka mwanalomi jonihoju. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Mu lichobha labhu la ndowa, Akisa akapiti kulobha ngonda kwaka Kalebu, tati waki. Panihapa Akisa akahulwiki kuhuma panani ja liponda laki, na Kalebu akundalukile, “Bho, upala nukupekya kike?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa akayangike, “Umbekya mbengalelu. Kwa kubha umbekihi ngonda ku pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache, nukulobha umbekyaje na pandu papabhili na chemichemi bhelabhela.” Bhela Kalebu akumpekihi chemuchemu ya machi ya kundonda, na chemuchemu ya machi ya pahi.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Michi ja likabila laka Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Aghoghu nde upwelelu ghobhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Yuda, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Michi jejabhili upambala wa kunkachi nakanopi mwa inchi ja Yuda kujenda ku ulindakanilu wa Edomu jakabhili Kabiseeli, Edeli na Yaguli, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />na Kina, Dimona na Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />na Kedeshi, Hazoli na Itinani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />na Zifu, Telemu na Bealoti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />na Hazoli Hadata, Kelioti Heziloni, yani Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />na Amamu, Shema na Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />na Hasali Gada, Heshimoni na Beti Peleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />na Hasali Shuali, Beeli Sheba na Biziotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />na Baala, Iyimu na Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />na Elitoladi, Kesili na Holima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />na Sikilagi, Madimana na Sanisana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />na Lebaoti, Shilihimu, Aini na Limoni. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili ishilini na tisa, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Michi jejabhili ku tutombi twa kolijibhi lyobha jakabhili Eshitaliti, Sola na Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />na Zanoa, Enganimu, Tapua na Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />na Yalimuti, Adulamu, Soko na Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />na Shaalaimu, Aditaimu, Gedela na Gedelotaimu. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi na nchechi, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi michi ja Senani, Hadasha na Migidali Gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />na Dileani, Misipa na Yokiteeli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />na Lakishi, Bosikati na Egiloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />na Kaboni, Lamasi na Kitilishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />na Gedeloti, Beti Dagoni, Naama na Makeda. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi na sita, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi michi ja Libina na Eteli na Ashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />na Yifita, Ashina na Nesibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />na Keila, Akizibu, na Malesha. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhi tisa, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi Ekiloni papamu na michi jaki na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />Kuhuma ku Ekiloni mbaka ku bahali ja Meditelania, yokapi yakabhili upambala wa Ashidodi, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Ashidodi, michi jaki papamu na ijiji yaki, papamu na Gaza, michi jaki na ijiji yaki, mbaka kuhika ku kikoka cha Misili na mumaheku ja bahali ja Meditelania.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Michi jejebhili ku inchi ja itombi jakabhili Shamili, Yatili na Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />na Dana na Kiliati Sana, yani Debili, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />na Anabu, Eshitemoa na Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />na Gosheni, Holoni na Gilo. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi na ghumu, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi michi ja Alabu, Duma na Eshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />na Yanimu, Beti Tapua na Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />na Humta, Kiliati Aliba, yani Hebuloni, na Sioli. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili tisa, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi michi ja Maoni, Kalimeli, Zifu na Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />na Yezileeli, Yokideamu na Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />na Kaini, Gibea na Timuna. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi michi ja Halihuli, Beti Suli na Gedoli, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />na Maalati, Beti Anoti na Elitekoni. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili sita, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Bhelabhela bhakapekiwi Kiliati Baali, yani Kiliati Yealimu, na Laba. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhi jibheli, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Michi ja kuchingwenji hoku jakabhili Beti Alaba, Midini na Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />na Nibishani, na Muchi wa mwinyu, na Engedi. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili sita, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Nambu bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda ngachebhaweziki kubhatopola Bhayebusi, bhabhakabhili bhatama ku Yelusalemu. Bhayebusi bhanihabha bhakali kutama papamu na bhandu bha likabilla laka Yuda mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Inchi jaka Efulaimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu kwa kulapula kula pakatumbwili pa nkoka Yoludani, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa muchi wa Yeliko, na kuhuma panihapa ukakweliki kupetela lipololu na kujingila mu inchi ja itombi ya Beseli. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Kuhuma ku Beseli ulindakanilu ukapiti ku Luzu, na ukapetiki ku Ataloti kobhakabhili bhatama Bhaaliki. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Kuhuma panihapa ukahelili ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa Bhayafuleti mbaka ku Beti Holoni ja pahi, na kuhika mbaka ku Gezeli, na kujomukela ku bahali ja Meditelania.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu, yani nusu ja likabila laka Manase na likabila laka Efulaimu, bhakapekiwi inchi jeniheji kubha upwelelu wabhu.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inchi ja likabila laka Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Efulaimu, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu bhakapatiki pandu pabhu ambapu ulindakanilu waki kwa upambala wa kolipita lyobha ukapetiki ku Ataloti Adali, mbaka ku Beti Holoni ja Kunane, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />na kujendalela mbaka ku bahali ja Meditelania. Kwa upambala wa kungonde ulindakanilu ukapetiki ku Mikimeta, na kuhuma panihapa ulindakanilu ukayongalwiti kujenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha mbaka ku Taanati Shilo, na kujendalela upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Yanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Kuhuma ku Yanoa ulindakanilu ukahelili pahi mbaka ku Ataloti na Naala, na kuhika mbaka ku Yeliko, na kujomukela ku nkoka wa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kuhuma ku Tapua ulindakanilu ukajendalili upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha mbaka ku kikoka cha Kana, na kujomukela ku bahali ja Meditelania. Aghoghu ukabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila la Bhaefulaimu, kwa kulengana na lukolu lwabhu, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />papamu na michi jokapi na ijiji yaki ambayu yakatengakiki kwa ndandi ja Bhaefulaimu mkati ja upwelelu wa nusu likabila laka Manase. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Bhaefulaimu ngachebhatopwili Bhakanaani bhabhakabhi bhatama ku Gezeli, nambu Bhakanaani bhatama pachilanda ja bhandu bhaka Efulaimu mbaka lalenu, koni bhakabya bhatumwa bha kuhenga mahengu gha kujomalakewa.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Inchi jaka Manase ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Manase joakabhili mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Yusufu, bhelabhela bhakapekiwi pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula. Makili, mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Manase na tati waki Gileadi, akajomwili kupekewa kwa kulapula kula michi ja Gileadi na Bashani, maghambu akabhili na makili namaa kungondo. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Bhangi bhabhahighalile bha likabila laka Manase bhakapekiwi pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. Lukolu yeniheyi yakabhili yela yaka Abiezeli, Heleki, Asilieli, Shekemu, Hefeli na Shemida. Abhabha nde bhabhelakeka bhangi bhaka Manase mwana waka Yusufu. <verse eid="JOS 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Nambu Selofehadi mwana waka Hefeli, mwana waka Gileadi, mwana waka Makili, mwana waka Manase, ngacheakabhili na mwana wa chikambaku, nambu akabhili na bhana akambomba pela, nabhombi bhakabhili Mahila, Noa, Hogila, Milika na Tiliza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Bhanihabha bhakunjendili mpenganyambiku Eleazali, na Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, na ihongozi bhangi na kubhapwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga akundaghalaki Musa atupekyaje upwelelu pachilanda ja bhalongu bhitu.” Bhela Yoshua akabhapekihi upwelelu wabhu papamu na bhalongu bha chikambaku bhaka tati wabhu, kulengana na lilaghalakilu laka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Ajeji nde ndandi ja likabila laka Manase kujonjukewa pandu komi patali na inchi ja Gileadi na Bashani, jejibhili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />Maghambu akakamwali abhabha bhaka Selofehadi kuhuma mu likabila laka Manase bhakajopalili upwelelu wabhu pachilanda ja bhana bha chikambaku bha likabila labhu. Inchi ja Gileadi bhakapekiwi bhabhelakeka bhangi bhabhahighalili bha chikambaku bhaka Manase.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Pandu paka Manase pakajaghanili kutumbula ku Asheli mbaka ku Mikimeta, kujenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Shekemu. Kuhuma panihapa ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukapiti upambala wa kunkachi, na kuhika mbaka pandu pabhakabhi bhatama bhenei bha Eni Tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Inchi ja Tapua jakabhili jaka Manase, nambu Tapua jeni jejibhili mu malindakanilu gha inchi jaka Manase, jakabhili mali gha bhabhelakeka bhaka Efulaimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Kuhuma panihapa ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukahelili upambala wa kunkache mbaka ku chikoka cha Kana. Kukabhili na michi jaka Efulaimu jejakabhili pachilanda ja michi jaka Manase, nambu ulindakanilu waka Manase ukabhili ku upambala wa kungonde wa kikoka chenihechi, na kujomukela ku bahali ja Meditelania. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Inchi ja upambala wa kunkachi jakabhili mali ghaka Efulaimu, na upambala wa kungonde ukabhili mali ghaka Manase, ulindakanilu waki ukabhili bahali ja Meditelania kwa upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. Likabila laka Asheli lakabhi ku upambala wa kungonde na kolijibhi lyobha, na Isakali akabhili ku upambala wa kungonde na kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Bhelabhela mu inchi ja likabila laka Isakali na Asheli, Manase akabhili na michi ja Beti Shani na ijiji yaki, Ibileamu na ijiji yaki, na bhenei bha Doli na michi jabhu, bhenei bha Endoli na michi jabhu, bhenei bha Taanaki na michi jabhu, bhenei bha Megido na michi jabhu, mbaka selusi ja muchi wa Nafoti. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Nambu bhabhelakeka bhaka Manase ngachebhaweziki kubhatopola bhenei bha muchi ghonihoghu, kwa kubha Bhakanaani bhakajomalakili nahuli bhajendalyaje kutama mu inchi jeniheji.<verse eid="JOS 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Hata bhela, Bhaizilaeli pabhajendalili kupata makili nakanopi bhakabhahengishi lihengu Bhakanaani, na kubhajomalakela kuhenga lihengu lelinonwipe, nambu ngachebhatopwili bhabhokaje.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu bhajonjukewa inchi ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu bhakundaluki Yoshua, “Bho, maghambu kiki utupekihi tepani pandu pamu pela kubha upwelelu witu? Maghambu tepani tubhili bhandu bhamaheli, na Bambo Chapanga atupengalili na kubha bhamaheli namaa sajenu.”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yoshua akayangike, “Ngati mwehapa mbili litaifa likolongwa la bhandu, na kubha inchi ja itombi jaka Efulaimu nde jichoku namaa kwinu, nkwelaje kuchitombi mkakechaje pandu kwa ndandi jinu mabhete ku inchi ja Bhapelizi na Bhalefai.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu bhakayangike, “Inchi ja itombi heji ngajutujaghanile, hata bhela Bhakanaani bhokapi bhabhatama ku inchi ja uwanda bhabhili na magali gha choma gha ngondo, bhelabhela bhokapi bhabhatama ku Beti Sheani papamu na ijiji yaki, na bhala bhabhatama ku libondi la Yezileeli.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Bhela Yoshua akalongili na bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu, yani Efulaimu na Manase, akapwaghaje, “Mwehapa mbili litaifa likolongwa la bhandu, nanamu mbili na makili namaa. Ngamwikubhi na pandu pamu pela pa upwelelu, <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />nambu bhelabhela na inchi ajeji ja itombi nde jinu. Hata ngati sajenu jibhi chitengu, nkechaje na kujitola jeniheji kutumbula upambala aghoghu mbaka komukaweza kuhika. Hata ngati Bhakanaani bhabhili na magali gha choma gha ngondo, nabhombi bhabhili na makili, mwehapa anamuwezaje kubhatopola bhanihabha.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Ughabhaniku wa inchi jejihighalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Bhela uhimanganu wokapi wa bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakahimangini papamu ku Shilo, na kuchenga Lihema Lihuhu. Inchi jeniheji jakabhili pahi ja utawala wabhu. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Nambu ghakahighalili makabila saba gha Izilaeli ambaghu ghakabhili ghakali ngacheghapatiki upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Bhela Yoshua akabhapwaghili Bhaizilaeli, “Bho, anandendalyaje mbaka lile nahuli kujingila na kujitama inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokolu bhinu, ampekihe? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Muhaghulaje bhandu bhatatu kuhuma mu kila likabila. Nanatu ananabhatumaje bhandu bhanihabha kujenda kujikaghula inchi jeniheji, na kunembela mapalu ghabhu kubhokana na upwelelu wa kila likabila, na panihapa bhinetilaje malobhi ghaki. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Mujighabhaje inchi jeniheji mu pandu saba. Yuda anaahighalyaje na pandu paki ku upambala wa kunkachi hoghu, na makabila ghaka Yusufu ku inchi jaki ku upambala wa kungondi hoku. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Ananjomwili kulemba malobhi gha pandu saba pa inchi jeniheji, mughaletaje kwangu nepani, nanatu ananundapulya kula pambani palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Nambu Bhalawi ngabhipati pandu pokapi pala pachilanda jinu, maghambu upwelelu wabhu nde kubha bhapenganyambiku na kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga. Nabhombi Gadi, Leubeni na nusu ja likabila laka Manase bhajomwili kupata upwelelu wabhu ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani, ambaku Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga akajomwili kubhapekeha.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Bhela, bhandu bhanihabha pabhakabhi bhabhoka na kujenda kujikaghula na kulemba malobhi gha inchi jeniheji, Yoshua akabhalaghalakile, “Njendaje mkapetaje pachilanda ja inchi jeniheji, na kulemba malobhi ghaki, na muhikaje kunetela, nanatu ananapulaje kula palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ku Shilo hoku.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Panihapa bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhokiki na kujenda kupeta pachilanda ja inchi jenijela, na kulemba malobhi ghaki mu chitabu, na kujighabha michi jaki mu pandu saba, na kukelabhuka kwaka Yoshua kulikambi ku Shilo hoku. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Bhela, Yoshua akalapwili kula kwa ndandi ja pandu panihapa palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mu Shilo, na panihapa akajighabhiki inchi jeniheji kwa Bhaizilaeli kulengana na makabila ghabhu.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Likabila la kutumbula kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Benyamini kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. Pandu pabhu pabhakapekiwi pakabhili pachilanda ja likabila la Yuda na makabila gha bhana bhaka Yusufu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Upambala wa kungonde ulindakanilu wabhu ukabhili kuhuma pa nkoka Yoludani, na kupetela kungonde ja mihelelu ja Yeliko na kujendalela upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa inchi ja itombi, na kupitalila mbaka kulipololu la Beti Aveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kuhuma panihapa ulindakanilu ukapetiki ku mihelelu ja upambala wa kunkachi ja Luzu, yani Beseli, na kuhelela mbaka ku Ataloti Adali mu chitombi cha upambala wa kunkachi ja Beti Holoni ja Pahi. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa chitombi chenihechi chechibhili ku upambala wa kunkachi ja Beti Holoni ulindakanilu ukayongalwiti kunkachi mbaka ku Kiliati Baali, yani Kiliati Yealimu, muchi wa bhandu bha likabila la Yuda. Aghoghu ukabhili ulindakanilu waki kwa upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Upambala wa kunkachi ulindakanilu ukatumbwili pa ujomukelu wa muchi wa Kiliati Yealimu, kwa upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, na kupitalila mbaka ku chemuchemu ya machi gha Nefitoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Ulindkanilu ukahelili mbaka pahi kupetela munkeghi ja chitombi chechibhili pambipi na libondi laka Beni Homomu, ambalu lakabhili kungondi nakanopi ja libondi la Bhalefai. Ukajendalili pahi pa libondi la Hinomu, kunkachi ja mihelelu ja Bhayebusi, na kuhelela mbaka ku Eni Logeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Konihoku ulindakanilu ukapendiki na kujenda kungondi mbaka ku Eni Shemeshi, na kujendalela mbaka ku Geliloti, ghoulingalanila na indela ja Adumimu, na kuhelela mbaka ku liganga laka Bohani mwana waka Leubeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Kuhuma panihapa ukajendalili kuyongolota kungondi ja nhwelelu wa Beti Alaba, na kujomukela ku libondi la nkoka wa Yoludani hoku. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Kabhete ulindakanilu ukajendalili ku nhwelelu wa kungondi wa Beti Hogila, na kupitalila ku chimbundi cha kungondi ja Bahali ja Mwinyu, pandu paujingila nkoka Yoludani. Aghoghu nde ulindakanilu wa ku upambala wa kunkachi. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Nkoka Yoludani ukabhili nde ulindakanilu waki kwa upambala wa kolipita lyobha. Aghagha ghakabhili nde malindakanilu ghaghalangihi upwelelu wa lukolu ya likabila laka Benyamini ku ipambala yokapi.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Ajeji nde michi ja lukolu ya likabila laka Benyamini kulengana na lukolu yabhu, Yeliko, Beti Hogila, Emeki Kesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />na Beti Alaba, Semalaimu na Beseli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />na Avimu, Pala na Ofila, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />na Kefali Amoni, Ofini na Geba. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi na jibheli, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Michi jengi jakabhili Gibeoni, Lama na Beeloti, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />na Misipa, Kefila na Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />na Lekemu, Ilipeeli na Talala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />na Zela, Elefu, muchi wa Bhayebusi, yani Yelusalemu, Gibeati na Kiliati Yealimu. Michi jeniheji jokapi jakabhili komi na nchechi, papamu na ijiji yaki. Aghoghu ukabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Benyamini kulengana na lukolu yabhu.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Simioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Likabila la kabheli kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Simioni kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. Upwelelu wabhu ukabhili pachilanda ja upwelelu wa likabila la Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Michi jebhakapatiki likabila laka Simioni kubha upwelelu wabhu jakabhili Beeli Sheba, Sheba na Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />na Hasali Shuali, Bala na Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />na Elitoladi, Betuli na Holima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />na Sikilagi, Beti Malikaboti na Hasali Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Beti Lebaoti na Shaluheni. Michi ajeji jokapi jakabhili komi na jitatu, papamu na ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Michi jengi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili Aini, Limoni, Eteli na Ashani. Michi jokapi jakabhili nchechi, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Papamu na ijiji yokapi yeiyongolota michi ajeji mbaka Baalati Beeli, yani Lama ghoubhili ku upambala wa kunkachi ja pandu pajomu. Aghoghu ukabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Simeoni, kulengana na lukolu yabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Upwelelu wa bhandu bha likabila laka Simeoni ukahumiki mu pandu pa likabila la Yuda. Maghambu pandu pa bhandu bha likabila la Yuda pakabhili pakolongwa namaa kwabhu. Bhela bhandu bha likabila laka Simeoni bhakabhili na upwelelu mkati ja pandu pa likabila la Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Zabuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Likabila la katatu kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Zabuloni kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. Ulindakanilu wa pandu pa upwelelu wabhu ukajaghanili mbaka ku Salidi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Kuhuma konihoku ulindakanilu ukapiti ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha mbaka ku Malala, ukapetiki munkeghi ja Dabesheti, na kuhika mbaka ku kikoka chechibhili ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha pambipi na Yokineamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Kuhuma ku Salidi, ukapiti ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha na kuhika mbaka ku ulindakanilu wa Kisiloti Uboli, na kujenda mbaka ku Dabelati, na kuhuma panihapa ukakweliki kujenda ku Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Kuhuma panihapa ukajendalili ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha mbaka ku Gati Hefeli, na kuhika mbaka ku Eti Kasini, na kupitalila ku Limoni na kung'anambuka kujenda ku Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Konihoku ulindakanilu ukayongalwiti ku upambala wa kungondi mbaka ku Hanatoni, na kujenda kujomukela ku libondi la Ifita Eli. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Jakabhili na michi ja Katati, Nahalali, Shimiloni, Idala na Beselehemu. Michi jokapi jakabhili komi na jibheli, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Michi ajeji na ijiji yaki yakabhili upwelelu wa likabila laka Zabuloni, kulengana na lukolu yabhu.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Isakali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Likabila la kacheche kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Isakali kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Pandu pabhu pakabhili muchi wa Yezileeli, Kesuloti na Shunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />na Hafalaimu, Shioni na Anahalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />na Labiti, Kishioni na Ebesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />na Lemeti, Eni Ganimu, Eni Hada na Beti Pasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukahikiki mbaka ku Taboli, Shahasuma na Beti Shemeshi, na kujomukela ku nkoka Yoludani. Michi jokapi jakabhili komi na sita, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Michi ajeji na ijiji yaki yakabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Isakali, kulengana na lukolu yabhu.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Asheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Likabila la kahanu kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Asheli kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Pandu pabhu pakabhili michi ja Helikati, Hali, Beteni na Akishafu, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />na Alameleki, Amadi na Mishali. Upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha ulindakanilu wabhu ukahikiki mbaka ku muchi wa Kalimeli na Shiholi Libinati. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Kuhuma konihoku ukang'anambwiki na kujenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha mbaka ku Beti Dagoni, na kulindakanila na likabila laka Zabuloni na libondi la Ifita Eli. Kuhuma panihapa ukapiti ku upambala wa kungondi mbaka ku Beti Emeki na Neyeli, na kujendalela kupeta kungondi mbaka ku Kabuli. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Ukajendalili mbaka ku Abidoni, Lehobu, Hamoni, Kana, na kuhika mbaka ku muchi ukolongwa wa Sidoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Ulindakanilu ghonihoghu ukang'anambwiki na kujenda ku Lama, na ku muchi wa Tilo ghoubhili na lumatu. Panihapa ukang'anambwiki kujenda ku Hosa, kujenda kupitalila kubahali ku inchi ja Akizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />na Uma, Afeka na Lehobu. Michi jokapi jakabhili ishilini na jibheli, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Michi ajeji na ijiji yaki yakabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Asheli, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Likabila la sita kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Nafutali kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Ulindakanilu wabhu ukatumbwili ku Hefeli, na nkongu ukolongwa wa mwaloni ghoubhili ku Saananimu, na kupeta mbaka ku Adami Nekebu na Yabineeli mbaka ku Lakumu, na kujomukela ku nkoka wa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Ulindakanilu ukajendalili ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha kujenda ku Azinoti Taboli na kupitalila ku Hukoki. Ukahikiki mbaka ku upambala wa kunkachi wa likabila laka Zabuloni, na kujenda mbaka ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa pandu pa likabila laka Asheli, na kuhika mbaka ku likabila laka Yuda ku nkoka wa Yoludani, ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Michi jejakabhili na lumatu jakabhili Sidimu, Seli, Hamati, Lakati na Kineleti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />na Adama, Lama na Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />na Kedeshi, Edilei na Eni Hasoli, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />na Iloni, Migidali Eli, Holemu, Beti Anati na Beti Shemeshi. Michi jokapi jakabhili komi na tisa, papamu na ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Michi jeniheji papamu na ijiji yaki yakabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Nafutali, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pabhakapekiwi bhandu bha likabila la Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Likabila la saba kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lakabhili laka Dani, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Pandu pa upwelelu wabhu pakabhili na michi ja Sola, Eshitaoli na Ili Shemeshi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />na Shaalabini, Aiyaloni na Itila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />na Eloni, Timuna na Ekuloni, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />na Eliteke, Gibetoni na Baalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />na Yehudi, Bene Belaki na Gatilimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />na Me Yalikoni, Lakoni, papamu na ulindakanilu ghoukabhili pambipi na Yafa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Nambu bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakang'ahakiki namaa kutamila pandu pabhu, bhela bhakakweliki kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Leshemu. Bhakautoliki mateka, na pabhajomwili kubhakoma bhenei bhokapi monihomu kwa lipanga, bhakatami monihomu, na kuupekeha lihina laka Dani, kwa kujengalela lihina laka Dani hokolu wabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Michi ajeji na ijiji yaki yakabhili nde upwelelu wa likabila laka Dani, kulengana na lukolu lwabhu.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu paakapekiwi Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli pabhakajomwili lihengu leniheli la kughabhana pandu pokapi pa inchi, bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakumpekihi Yoshua, mwana waka Nuni upwelelu pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile, Bhaizilaeli bhakumpekihi muchi ambau akauhawili mweni, yani Timunati Sela ghoubhili mu inchi ja itombi ya Efulaimu. Najombi akauchengiki muchi na kutama konihoku.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Bhela, panihapa nde pandu ambapu mpenganyambiku Eleazali na Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, papamu na ihongozi bha lukolu ya makabila gha bhandu bha Izilaeli ghabhaghabhiki kwa kulapula kula ku Shilo palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, pundyangu wa kujingalila mu Lihema Lihuhu. Bhela, bhakajomwili kujighabha inchi.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Michi ja kukembalela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Hesabu 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kombukombu la Tolati 19:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Ubhapwaghilaje bhandu bha Izilaeli, bhahaghulaje michi ja kukembalela, ngati monalaghalakile kwa kupetela chiwoku chaka Musa. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Nahuli mundu jokapi anaankomiki mundu panga kuholakela, na panga kumanya, apataje kukembalela konihoku. Anapakubhaje pandu pa kukembalela kwinu mwehapa, kuntila mundu jola joapala kulepa kisasi kwa ndandi ja mwahi. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Paakembalela mu ghumu wa michi ajeji, ajemaje mu ndyangu ukolongwa wa kujingalila muchi ghonihoghu, na kubhalandila bhazee bha muchi ghonihoghu panani ja malobhi ghaki. Panihapa anabhunjopalyaje mu muchi wabhu, na kumpekeha pandu, nahuli apataje kutama pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Ngati mundu joapala kulepa kisasi anaanjengalili, bhazee bha muchi ghonihoghu ngabhumpekeha mundu jola joankomiki njaki, maghambu akunkomiki njaki panga kuholakela, wala ngacheakunhakalili kutumbu pakutumbula hapa. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Mundu hoju joankomiki njaki anaatamaje mu muchi ghonihoghu, mbaka payijemaje palongi ja uhimanganu nahuli kutemuliwa na mbaka payipotilaje mpenganyambiku nkolongwa joatumika mu chikahi chenihechi. Panihapa aweza kubhuja kunyumba jaki, ku muchi ambau akautiliki pakutumbula hapa.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Bhela bhakatengiki muchi wa Kadeshi mu Galilaya, ghoubhili mu inchi ja itombi ja Nafutali, Shekemu mu inchi ja itombi ya Efulaimu na Kiliati Aliba, yani Hebuloni mu inchi ja itombi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Bhelabhela kwihi ja kabheli ja nkoka wa Yoludani, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Yeliko, bhakahawili muchi wa Bezeli ghoubhili kulipololu, mu inchi ja uwanda ja likabila laka Leubeni, Lamoti mu Gileadi mu likabila laka Gadi, na Golani ku Bashani mu likabila laka Manase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Muizilaeli jokapi au ngeni jokapi joatama pachilanda jabhu anaankomiki mundu panga kuholakela, aweza kukembalela mu michi jeniheji jejitengakiki, nahuli ngayikomakeka na mundu jola joapala kulepa kisasi cha mwahi, mbaka payikubhaje ajemiki palongi ja uhimanganu wokapi.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Michi ja Bhalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Bhela, chikahi chenihechi ihongozi bha Bhalawi bhakunjendili mpenganyambiku Eleazali, na Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, na ihongozi bhangi bha lukolu ya makabila gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />Bhakalongili nabhu ku Shilo hoku, mu inchi ja Kanaani, na kubhapwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga akalaghalakili kupetela Musa kubha mtupekyaje michi ja kutama, papamu na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama hitu ya kudimakika.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhapekihi Bhalawi michi jeniheji, papamu na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama yabhu ya kudimakika, kubha upwelelu wabhu, ngati moakalaghalakile Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Lukolu lwa kutumbula kupata pandu pabhu kwa kulapula kula lwakabhili lukolu ya Bhakohati. Bhalawi bhabhakabhili bhabhelakeka bhaka mpenganyambiku Haluni bhakapekiwi michi komi na jitatu kuhuma mu makabila gha Yuda, Simeoni na Benyamini. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Bhabhelakeka bhangi bhabhahighalile bha lukolu lwa Bhakohati bhakapekiwi michi komi kuhuma mu lukolu ya makabila ghaka Efulaimu, Dani na nusu ja likabila laka Manase upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka lukolu lwaka Gelishoni bhakapekiwi michi komi na jitatu kuhuma mu lukolu ya makabila ghaka Isakali, Asheli, Nafutali na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku Bashani upambala wa kolipita lyobha.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Bhabhelakeka bha lukolu lwaka Melali bhakapekiwi michi komi na jibheli kuhuma mu makabila ghaka Leubeni, Gadi na Zabuloni.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhapekihi Bhalawi michi jeniheji, papamu na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama yabhu ya kudimakika, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile kupetela kwaka Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Aghagha nde mahina gha michi jebhakapekiwi kuhuma mu makabila ghaka Yuda na Simeoni. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Michi ajeji bhakapekiwi bhabhelakeka bhaka Haluni, ambabhu bhakabhokini na lukolu ya Bhakohati bhabhakabhili bha likabila laka Lawi, maghambu kula ja kutumbula jakabhapatiki bhombi. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Bhakabhapekihi Kiliati Aliba, yani Hebuloni, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama yeiyongalwite muchi ghonihoghu, mu inchi ja itombi ya Yuda. Aliba akabhili tati waka Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Nambu mighonda jejayongalwiti muchi ghonihoghu papamu na ijiji yaki, bhakumpekihi Kalebu mwana waka Yefune kubha pandu paki.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Bhela bhabhelakeka bhaka mpenganyambiku Haluni bhakapekiwi Hebuloni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Hebuloni ukabhili muchi wa kukembalela kwa ndandi jaka mundu jokapi jola joakoma: Libina papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />na Yatili papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, Eshitemoa papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />na Holoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Debili papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />na Aini papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, Yuta papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama na Beti Shemeshi papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jakabhili tisa kuhuma kwa makabila aghagha ghabheli, yani Yuda na Simeoni. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Kuhuma kwa likabila laka Benyamini bhakabhapekihi Gibeoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Geba papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />na Anatoti papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Alimoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi bhabhelakeka bhaka Haluni, ambabhu bhakabhili bhapenganyambiku, jakabhili michi komi na jitatu, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Bhandu bhangi bhabhahighalile bha lukolu lwa Bhakohati, ambabhu bhakabhokini na Bhalawi, bhakapekiwi michi kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Efulaimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Kuhuma mu inchi ja itombi yaka Efulaimu bhakapekiwi muchi wa Shekemu, ambau ukabhili muchi wa kukembalela kwaka mundu jokapi jola joakoma, na Gezeli papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />na Kibisaimu papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Beti Holoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Dani bhakapekiwi Eliteke papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Gibetoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />na Aiyaloni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Gati Limoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Kuhuma mu nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, bhakapekiwi Taanaki papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Gati Limoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili jibheli. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Bhela, michi jebhakapekiwi bhandu bhabhakahighalile bha lukolu yaka Kohati jakabhili michi komi, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Lukolu lwaka Gelishoni, kuhuma mu likabila la Bhalawi, bhakapekiwi michi jibheli kuhuma mu nusu ja pandu pa likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha. Michi jeniheji jakabhi Golani mu Bashani muchi wa kukembalela kwaka mundu jokapi jola joakoma, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Beeshitela papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili jibheli. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Isakali, bhakapekiwi muchi wa Kishioni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Debelati papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />na Yalimuti papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Enganimu papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Asheli, bhakapekiwi muchi wa Mishali papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Abidoni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />na Helikati papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Lehobu papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Nafutali, bhakapekiwi Kedeshi muchi wa kukembalela kwaka mundu jokapi jola joakomiki, ghoubhili ku Galilaya papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Hamoti Doli papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Kalitani papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili jitatu. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi lukolu ya Bhagelishoni jakabhili komi na jitatu, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Lukolu lwaka Melali, kuhuma mu likabila la Bhalawi, bhakapekiwi michi kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Zabuloni. Michi jeniheji jakabhi Yokineamu papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Kalita papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />na Dimina papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Nahalali papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Leubeni bhakapekiwi, Bezeli papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, Yahasa papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />na Kedomoti papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Mefaati papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Kuhuma mu pandu pa likabila laka Gadi bhakapekiwi Lamoti mu Gileadi, muchi wa kukembalela kwaka mundu jokapi joakoma, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Mahanaimu papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />na Heshiboni papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama, na Yazeli papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi jakabhili nchechi. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi bhabhelakeka bhaka Melali, yani mahighalilu gha likabila la Bhalawi, jakabhili michi komi na jibheli.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Michi jokapi jebhakapekiwi likabila la Bhalawi kuhuma mu pandu pa Bhaizilaeli jakabhili michi alobaini na nane, papamu na pandu paki pa kulekeha hinyama. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Kila ghumu pachilanda ja michi ajeji jakayongalitwi na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama. Bhenibhela nde mokwabhelile kwa michi jeniheji jokapi.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhatola inchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhapekihi bhandu bha Izilaeli inchi jeniheji jokapi, jeakalapiki kubhapekeha akahokolu bhabhu, nabhombi bhakajitoliki na kutama monihomu. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhapekihi lipomulelu ipambala yokapi, ngati moakabhalapile akahokolu bhabhu, njeta adui hata jumu joakaweziki kubhaweza palongi jabhu. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga akabhabhekiki adui bhabhu bhokapi pahi ja lujiniku lwabhu. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Njeta hata chilanga chimu chamboni chaka Bambo Chapanga kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli ambachu ngachechatimile. Kila chilanga chakatimie.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gha kolipita lyobha ghakelabhuka kunyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Bhela Yoshua akabhalohiki bhandu bha likabila la Bhaleubeni, Bhagadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />na kubhapwaghila, “Mwehapa njomwili kughahenga mambu ghokapi ghamwalaghalakiwi na Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, nanamu ntehi kutii sauti jangu kwa kila lijambu lenakundaghalakile. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Wala ngachemubhalekiki bhalongu bhinu Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi chenihechi chokapi chilachu mbaka lalenu, nambu nkamwili wichu amuli yeakumpekihe Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Sajenu kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhapekihi bhalongu bhinu Bhaizilaeli lipomulelu ngati moakabhalaghile. Bhela nkelabhukaje kunyumba jinu mu inchi jela ambaju Musa mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, akumpekihi mwehapa jikubhaje mali ghinu, yani kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Nambu mulilingalyaje impalika kutii nakanopi amuli na shelia yokapi ambayu Musa, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akundaghalakile. Kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kujenda mu indela yaki yokapi, na kuikamula amuli yaki, na kukamulana najombi kwa uchakaka, na kuntumakila jombi kwa mtima winu wokapi na roho jinu jokapi.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Bhela Yoshua akabhapengalili, na kubhalaghila bhajendaje, nabhombi bhakapiti kunyumba jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Musa akabhili ajomwili kubhapekeha nusu ja likabila laka Manase upwelelu wabhu mu Bashani ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha. Nambu nusu jengi ja likabila leniheli, Yoshua akabhili abhapekihi upwelelu wabhu ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha ja nkoka Yoludani papamu na bhalongu bhabhu. Yoshua paakabhili abhalaghila bhajendaje kunyumba jabhu, akabhapengalili, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />akapwaghaje, “Nkelabhukaje kunyumba hinu na wamaheli wa hindu hinu, yani mapogha makolongwa gha hinyama ya kudimakika, koni mkabyaje na madini gha feza, zahabu, shaba, choma, na ingobhu yamaheli namaa. Mkaghabhanaje na bhalongu bhinu hindu yeniheyi yokapi yemwitoliki mateka kuhuma kwa maadui bhinu.” <verse eid="JOS 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Bhela bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, likabila laka Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakabhalekiki Bhaizilaeli ku Shilo mu inchi ja Kanaani, nahuli kukelabhuka ku Gileadi, inchi jabhu bheni jebhakajipatiki kulengana na lilaghalakilu laka Bambo Chapanga kupetela kwaka Musa.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihanja cha nyambiku pambipi na nkoka Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Bhela pabhahikiki pa Geliloti pambipi na nkoka Yoludani, mu inchi ja Kanaani, Bhaleubeni, Bhagadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakachengiki chihanja chikolongwa na chinyahi cha kubhokela nyambiku pambipi na nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Bhaizilaeli bhakajowini, “Lingalyaje! Bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhachengiki chihanja cha nyambiku ku ulindakanilu wa Kanaani ku Geliloti hoku, pambipi na nkoka Yoludani ku upambala bha bhandu bha Izilaeli!” <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli pabhajowini ghanihagha, lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakahimangini papamu ku Shilo hoku, nahuli kujenda kukomana nabhu ngondo.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakuntumiki Finehasi mwana waka mpenganyambiku Eleazali, ku Gileadi kwa bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Finehasi akabhokiki papamu na ihongozi komi, chiongozi jumu kwa kila likabila limu la Izilaeli ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, kila jumu akabhili chiongozi pachilanda ja bhandu bha makabila gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Pabhahikiki ku inchi ja Gileadi, kwa bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakabhapwaghile, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Lipogha lokapi laka Bambo Chapanga lilalukila, ‘Bho, lihakau bholi aleli lemuhengiki panani jaka Chapanga wa Izilaeli? Bho, muweza bholi kundeka Bambo Chapanga, na kulichengela chihanja cha nyambiku na kumpenga Bambo Chapanga? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Bho, mahoku ghatahengiki ku Peoli hoku le ngacheghajaghanile? Hata ngati kukabhili na chitamu cha tauni panani ja lipogha laka Bambo Chapanga, nambu mbaka lalenu tukali ngachetugholuliki kubhokana na lihoku leniheli! <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Bho, sajenu nde ndandi lelu mundeka Bambo Chapanga? Ngati anamkana kuntii Bambo Chapanga lalenu, chilabhu anaalihyomilaje lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Bhela, anangati inchi jinu jijeghaliki uhakau, ndombukaje na kujingila kongoni mu inchi jaka Bambo Chapanga, pandu ambapu lihema laka Bambo Chapanga palibhile, nanamu ntolaje pandu kuhuma pachilanda jitu. Nambu ngamwampenga Bambo Chapanga, wala panani jitu tepani kwa kulichengela chihanja cha nyambiku, nakanopi ja chihanja chela chaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Chikahi Akani mwana waka Zela paakakosiki ulongwana kwa hindu yeyabhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, bho, inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga ngachejabhili panani ja lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha izilaeli? Bho, ngacheakabhili Akani pela kanjika jaki joakapotili kwa ndandi ja lihoku lake?’ ”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Panihapa bhandu bha likabila laka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakabhayangiki ihongozi bha lukolu ya Izilaeli, bhakapwaghaje, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Bambo Chapanga Joabhi na Makile nde Chapanga! Bambo Chapanga Joabhi na Makile nde Chapanga! Jombi amanyi ndandi jitu tepani kuhenga bhenibhela, na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhamanyaje. Ngati aghoghu nde uasi au kulepa kubha na uhobhalelu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, ngamwatuleka kubha tabhomi mu lichobha la lalenu! <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Ngati anatulichengili chihanja chitu cha nyambiku nahuli kundeka Bambo Chapanga, na kubhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka, au nhupu ya ilebhi, au nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwale, bhela, Bambo Chapanga mweni na alitemulaje lijambu aleli lalenu. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Nambu ngabhela. Tukahengiki bhenibhela kwa choghoi kubha machobha ghaghahika bhabhelakeka bhinu bhaweza kubhapwaghila bhabhelakeka bhitu, ‘Mwehapa mbili na uhusianu bholi na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Bambo Chapanga autendiki nkoka Yoludani kubha ulindakanilu pachilanda jitu na mwehapa, mwehapa bhandu bhaka Leubeni na Gadi ngachembili na pandu pimu kwaka Bambo Chapanga.’ Bhela bhabhelakeka bhinu bhaweza kubhatenda bhabhelakeka bhitu kukotoka kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Ajeji nde ndandi tukapwaghiki, ‘Tulichengilaje changili chihanja achechi, nambu nga kwa ndandi ja kubhokela nyambiku ya kujochakeka wala nhupu yokapi yela.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />Nambu anachikubhaje ulandilu pachilanda jitu tepani na mwehapa, na ibheleku yeihika, kubha anatunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga mu pandu paki pahuhu, kwa nyambiku hitu ya kujochakeka, nhupu hitu na nhupu ya kutama kwa lukwale. Nahuli mu machobha ghaghahika, bhabhelakeka bhinu ngabhiweza kubhapwaghila bhabhelakeka bhitu, ‘Mwehapa ngachembili na pandu pokapi pala muka Bambo Chapanga.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Bhela tukapwaghiki kubha anangati chikahi chokapi chela anabhatupwaghili lijambu leniheli, au kubhapwaghila bhabhelakeka bhitu, anatubhayangaje anana, ‘Ndingalyaje, ulenganesu ghongoni wa chihanja chaka Bambo Chapanga, ambachu akatati bhitu bhakachichengike, nga kwa ndandi ja kubhokela nyambiku ya kujochakeka na nhupu, nambu ngati ulandilu pachilanda jitu tepani na mwehapa.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Lijambu aleli la kumuasi Bambo Chapanga, na kundeka mu lichobha la lalenu kwa kuchenga chihanja cha kubhokela nyambiku ya kujochakeka, nhupu ya ilebhi, na nhupu yengi, nakanopi ja chihanja cha kubhokela nyambiku chaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, chechibhili palongi ja lihema laki, na likubhaje kutali na tepani.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Bhela mpenganyambiku Finehasi, ihongozi bha lipogha, na ihongozi bha lukolu ya bhandu bha Izilaeli, pabhakajowini malobhi ghabhapwaghiki Bhaleubeni, Bhagadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakalizike. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Najombi Finehasi, mwana waka mpenganyambiku Eleazali, akabhapwaghili bhandu bhaka Leubeni, Gadi na nusu ja likabila laka Manase ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, “Lalenu tumanyi kubha Bambo Chapanga abhili papamu na tepani, maghambu ngachemwalepiki kubha na ulongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga mu lijambu aleli. Bhela, sajenu mubhakengalili bhandu bha Izilaeli kuhuma mu kuyonangeka na chiwoku chaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Bhela, Finehasi mwana waka mpenganyambiku Eleazali, papamu na ihongozi bhajaki bhala, bhakabhalaghili bhandu bha makabila ghaka Leubeni na Gadi ku Gileadi hoku, bhakakelawiki ku inchi ja Kanaani na kubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli malobhi ghanihagha. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Malobhi ghanihagha ghakabhatendiki Bhaizilaeli kuhekalela namaa, nabhombi bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakundumbalili Chapanga, wala ngachebhalongalili kabheti panani ja kukomana ngondo, nahuli kujiyonanga inchi jebhakabhi bhatama bhandu bha makabila ghaka Leubeni na Gadi.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Bhela bhandu bha makabila ghaka Leubeni na Gadi, bhakachilohiki chihanja cha maganga cha kubhokela nyambiku hechi, “Edi,” yani “Mlandilu.” Maghambu bhakapwaghiki, “Chihanja achechi anachikubha ulandilu pachilanda jitu tepani na mwehapa kubha Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua abhalaghila ihongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Bhela pachapetiki chikahi chilachu, Bambo Chapanga akabhapekihi bhandu bha Izilaeli lipomulelu palongi ja maadui bhabhu bhokapi bhabhayongalwite. Chikahi chenihechi Yoshua akabhili mzee ya hyaka yamaheli. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Yoshua akabhalohiki bhandu bhokapi bha izilaeli, bhazee bhokapi, ihongozi bhabhu, bhatemula na maofisa bhabhu, na kubhapwaghila, “Sajenu nepani mili mzee wa hyaka yamaheli. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mwehapa mabhete mughaweni mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ghaabhahengile mataifa aghagha ghokapi kwa ndandi jinu. Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde joankomanile. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Nkombukaje ntundu monungabhanakile kwa kulapula kula mataifa aghagha ghaghahighalile, kubha upwelelu kwa makabila ghinu, yani mataifa ghanaghawezike, kutumbula ku nkoka Yoludani mbaka ku bahali ja Meditelania, ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, anaabhabhohaje maadui bhinu kwa makili bhabhokaje palongi jinu. Anaabhatopulaje ngabhikubha kabhete palongi jinu, nanamu anamjitawalaje inchi jabhu, ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moakundaghile. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Bhela mkangamalaje namaa kughakamula ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu chitabu cha Shelia yaka Musa, na kughatenda, wala ngamughaleka kwa kung'ambambukila ku upambala wa kumalelelu au upambala wa kumangeja. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Ngamwijangatana na mataifa aghagha ghaghahighalili pachilanda jinu, wala ngamwilobha kwa mahina gha ichapanga yabhu, wala ngamwaijojabhela, wala kubhalapisha bhandu kwa mahina ghanihagha, ngamwaitumakila wala kuichikamila palongi jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Nambu nkamulanaje kwa ulongwana na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngati montendile mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga aghatopwili palongi jinu mataifa makolongwa na ghaghabhi na makili, na kwinu mwehapa njeta mundu hata jumu joaweza kujema palongi jinu mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Mundu jumu pachilanda jinu anaawezaje kubhatopola bhandu elufu jimu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nde joankomanela mwehapa, ngati moakundaghile. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Bhela, impalika mkangamalaje namaa, kumpala Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Nambu ngati anamng'anambwiki kwa kukamulana na mahighalilu gha mataifa aghagha ghaghahighalili pachilanda jinu, na ngati anantoghulini nabhu na kujangatana nabhu, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />bhela mmanyaje kubha chakaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngaabhatopoli kabhete mataifa ghanihagha palongi jinu. Nambu anaghakubhaje kwinu chihibhalakilu na chimbenda kwinu. Anaghakubhaje ngati iboku ya ndomondo mu mighongu jinu na miha mumihu ghinu, mbaka pamwiyonangikaje na kubhoka mu inchi ajeji jinyahi, ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ampekihi mwehapa.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Sajenu nepani nheghalile kupotela na kujenda mu indela ja bhandu bhokapi bha pundema. Mmanyi mu mitima jinu na roho hinu kubha njeta chilanga chokapi chela ambachu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akundaghili, ambachu chikali ngakupitalila. Kila chilanga chitimizwe, njeta hata chimu changakupitalila. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Nambu ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, moatimizile mambu ghokapi ghamboni ghaakalaghile, bhelabhela aweza kundetela mahakau ghokapi mbaka anjonangaje mabhokapi kubhoka mu inchi ajeji jinyahi, ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, jeampeki mwehapa. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Ngati anamuhekiti lulaghilu lwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ambalu akundaghalakili mwehapa mlukamulaje, kwa kujenda kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi, na kuichikamila, bhela, inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga anajibhelalaje panani jinu, nanamu anamuyonangikaje manyata kuhuma mu inchi ajeji jinyahi jeampeki mwehapa.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua alongela na bhandu ku Shekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Bhela Yoshua akabhabhongini papamu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli ku Shekemu hoku, na kubhaloha bhazee, ihongozi, bhatemula na maofisa bha Izilaeli, nabhombi bhakahikiki palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yoshua akabhapwaghi bhandu bhokapi, “Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli apwagha anana, ‘Pamwandi hapa akahokolu bhinu, papamu na Tela tati waka Ibulahimu na Naholi, bhakatami kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati, na kuijojabhela ichapanga nayenge. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Nambu nepani nakumbohiki Ibulahimu hokolu winu kuhuma kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati, nakundongwihi mu inchi jokapi ja Kanaani, na kumpekeha bhabhelakeka bhamaheli. Nakumpekihi Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />najombi Isaka nakumpekihi Yakobo na Esau. Nepani nakumpekihi Esau inchi ja chitombi cha Seili atamaje, nambu Yakobo papamu na bhana bhaki bhakahelili ku Misili. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Bhela nakabhatumiki Musa na Haluni, nanatu nakajilapwili inchi ja Misili, kwa mambu ghokapi ghanahengiki pachilanda ja inchi jeniheji, na kumboha mwehapa konihoku. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Nakabhabhohiki akahokolu bhinu ku Misili, nanamu mkahikiki mbaka kumaheku ja bahali ja Shamu. Bhamisili bhakunjengalili mwehapa kwa magali gha kuhutakika gha ngondo, na manjolinjoli bhakwela falasi mbaka ku bahali ja Shamu. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli pabhakanelili nepani Bambo Chapanga kupala ujangatilu, nakabhekiki lubhendu pachilanda jinu na Bhamisili, na kuleta bahali jabhahyekaje panani jabhu. Mwehapa mabhete mkaweni kwa mihu ghinu mambu ghala ghanabhahengili pachilanda jabhu ku Misili hoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:7">“ ‘Nanamu mkatami kulipololu hoku kwa machobha ghamaheli. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Bhela nukundetiki mwehapa mu inchi ja Bhaamoli bhabhakabhili bhatama ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa nkoka Yoludani. Bhakakomini na mwehapa, nambu nepani nakabhajeghili nakabhatendiki bhalepalyaje palongi jinu. Nakabhayoningi palongi jinu, nanamu mkajitoliki mateka inchi jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Chikahi Balaki mwana waka Sipoli, nkolongwa wa Moabu, paakalibhekiki wichu kukomana na bhandu bha Izilaeli, akundohiki Balaamu mwana waka Beoli, nahuli ahikaje kubhapekeha masolu. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Nambu nepani ngachenajetakili kunjowanela Balaamu, bhela akajendalili kumpengalela kabheti na kabheti. Panihapa nakunkengalili mwehapa kuhuma mu chiwoku chaki. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha mkalombwiki nkoka Yoludani na kuhika ku Yeliko. Nabhombi bhandu bha ku Yeliko bhakakomini na mwehapa. Bhelabhela mwehapa mkakomini na Bhaamoli, Bhapelizi, Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhagiligashi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi, nambu bhanihabha bhokapi nakabhabhekiki pahi ja lujiniku lwinu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Pamukabhili njingila mu inchi jeniheji nakatumiki manyiwa palongi jinu, ambaghu ghakabhatopwili palongi jinu bhakolongwa bhanihabha bhabheli bha Bhaamoli. Nga mapanga ghinu, wala mishali jinu jejuntendiki mwehapa kupata kubhaweza. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Bhela nepani numpekihi mwehapa inchi ambaju ngachemujihengili lihengu, na michi jangakujichenga mwehapa jentama sajenu mkati jaki. Mkula mapambiku gha mighonda ja mizabibu ambaghu ngachemwapandike, na mkula mizeituni ambaju ngachemwapandike.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />“Yoshua akajendalili kupwagha, ‘Henu, munjojabya Bambo Chapanga, na kuntumakila kwa ulongwana na uchakaka wokapi. Ndekalaje kutali ichapanga ambayu akahokolu bhinu bhakaijojabhili kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati, na ku Misili hoku. Nanamu muntumakyaje Bambo Chapanga pela!’ <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Nambu ngati anambona kubha nga wichu kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga, muhaghulaje lalenu joanamuntumakyaje, anangati ichapanga yela ambayu akahokolu bhinu bhakaitumakili kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati, au ichapanga ya Bhaamoli, ambabhu sajenu mtama mu inchi jabhu. Nambu nepani na bhandu bha munyumba jangu, anatuntumakyaje Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Bhela bhandu bhanihabha bhakayangike, “Ngabhela! Lijambu aleli la kundeka Bambo Chapanga, na kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi likubhaje kutali na tepani! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga mweni nde joatubhohiki tepani na akahokolu bhitu kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili, inchi jetukabhili bhatumwa, na kutenda nginyulila yela ikolongwa palongi ja mihu ghitu. Jombi nde joakatulendiki mu mwanja witu wokapi, na kwa bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi ghatwapetiki pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Bambo Chapanga nde joakabhatopwili bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi bhabhokaje palongi jitu, yani Bhaamoli bhabhakabhi bhatama mu inchi jenjenu. Bhela, kwa ndandi jeniheji tepani nanatu anatuntumakyaje Bambo Chapanga, maghambu jombi nde Chapanga witu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Nambu Yoshua akabhapwaghile, “Mwehapa ngamuwezi kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga, maghambu jombi nde Chapanga Mhuhu. Chapanga joabhi na wihu, najombi ngaandekakeli mwehapa makosa ghinu, wala mahoku ghinu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Ngati anamundekiki Bambo Chapanga na kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi, panihapa anang'anambukaje na kuntendela mambu mahakau, na kunjonanga nakanopi, hata ngati antendili ghamboni aghagha ghokapi kunyuma hoku.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Bhandu bhanihabha bhakumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ngabhela! Nambu tepani anatuntumakyaje Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Panihapa Yoshua akabhapwaghile, “Mwehapa mbili bhalandilu panani jinu mabhete kubha muhawili kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Nabhombi bhakayangike, “Ena, tepani nde bhalandilu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Yoshua akabhapwaghile, “Henu, ndekalaje kutali ichapanga yeniheyi yeibhili pachilanda jinu, nanamu mjipelakaje mitima jinu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Bhandu bhanihabha bhakumpwaghi Yoshua, “Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, nde joanatunjojabyaje, na kujitii sauti jaki.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Bhela Yoshua akatendiki lulaghilu na bhandu bhanibhala mu lichobha lenilela, na kubhapekeha amuli na malaghalakilu gha kujengalela ku Shekemu hoku. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Yoshua akaghalembiki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi mu chitabu cha Shelia jaka Chapanga. Panihapa akatoliki liganga likolongwa, na kulijemeka konihoku pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni, ghoukabhili pambipi na pandu pahuhu paka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yoshua akajendalili kubhapwaghi bhandu bhokapi, “Ndingalyaje! Liganga aleli analikubhaje ulandilu pachilanda jitu. Maghambu lijowini mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga ghaatupwaghile. Bhela analikubhaje ulandilu panani jinu, ngati anamundekiki Chapanga winu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Bhela Yoshua akabhapwaghili bhandu bhabhokaje, nabhombi bhakapiti kila mundu ku pandu pa upwelelu waki.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Yoshua na Eleazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Bhela, paghajomwiki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi, Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, akapotili koni akabya na umuli wa hyaka mia jimu na komi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Nabhombi bhakuntaghiki mu inchi ja upwelelu waki, ku Timuna Sela hoku, mu inchi ja itombi ya Efulaimu, ku upambala wa kungonde ja chitombi cha Gaashi.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakuntumakili Bambo Chapanga machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaka Yoshua, na machobha ghokapi gha bhazee bhala bhabhakatami baada ja kupotela kwaka Yoshua, ambabhu bhakaweni kila chindu Bambo Chapanga cheakabhatendili bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Nayombi ihupa yaka Yusufu, ambayu Bhaizilaeli bhakaikwehiki kuhuma ku Misili hoku, bhakaitaghiki ku Shekemu, pandu ambapu Yakobo akapahemili kuhuma kwa bhana bhaka Hamoli, tati waka Shekemu, kwa ipandi mia jimu ya madini gha feza. Pandu panihapa nde papakabhili upwelelu wa bhabhelakeka bhaka Yusufu.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Najombi Eleazali mwana waka Haluni, akapotili na kutaghakika ku Gibea hoku, muchi wa kuchitombi ghoakapekiwi Finehasi mwana waki, ku inchi ja itombi ya Efulaimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>